window.DPO_I18N={"，覆盖海盆地形、海水物性与全球温盐密度结构；点击图片可查看原始截图。":", covering ocean basin topography, seawater physical properties and global temperature and salt density structure; click on the image to view the original screenshot.","，给出代表性的年平均气候态范围。若课件使用“向上为正”，Q":", giving a representative annual average climate state range. If the courseware uses \"up is positive\", Q","，其中副热带北大西洋、南大西洋最明显，北太平洋和南太平洋副热带也为净蒸发区；地中海、红海和阿拉伯海等干燥海域尤其突出。相反，ITCZ、季风强降水区以及许多高纬海区通常降水大于蒸发。":", among which the subtropical North Atlantic and South Atlantic are the most obvious, and the North Pacific and South Pacific subtropics are also net evaporation areas; dry sea areas such as the Mediterranean Sea, the Red Sea, and the Arabian Sea are especially prominent. In contrast, precipitation in the ITCZ, heavy monsoon precipitation areas, and many high-latitude sea areas usually exceeds evaporation.","，全球定义和观测中常落在":", which often falls into the global definition and observation of","；南京大学讲座补充调和分析原理与应用。":";Nanjing University Lecture Supplementary Harmonic Analysis Principles and Applications.","。必须同时说明混合层深度 h、卷入速度 w":". The mixed layer depth h and roll-in speed w must be specified at the same time.","。程序使用固定分析时段，避免数据持续更新导致结果漂移。":". The program uses a fixed analysis period to avoid result drift caused by continuous data updates.","。冬季表面失热造成对流混合时可加深到数百米；在拉布拉多海、北欧海和南大洋等深对流区，极端情况下可超过":". In winter, when surface heat loss causes convective mixing, it can deepen to hundreds of meters; in deep convective areas such as the Labrador Sea, the Nordic Sea, and the Southern Ocean, it can exceed 100 meters in extreme cases.","。锋面和涡旋区还应保留次网格或涡旋热输送。":". Frontal and vortex regions should also retain subgrid or vortex heat transport.","“海面有起伏”并不意味着它们都属于通常所说的表面波。区分时间尺度、空间尺度和主要控制机制，才能为数据采样和模型设计选择合适的目标。":"\"There are undulations on the sea surface\" does not mean that they are all what is commonly called surface waves. Distinguishing between temporal scales, spatial scales, and primary control mechanisms enables the selection of appropriate targets for data sampling and model design.","“极值中心与数值”不是普适常数。精确作答应注明数据集（如 OAFlux、ERA5 或 NOC）、平均时段、网格分辨率及海冰掩膜；西边界流的粗网格产品往往低估峰值。":"\"Extremum center and value\" are not universal constants. Precise experiments should indicate the data set (e.g. OAFlux, ERA5 or NOC), averaging period, grid resolution and sea ice mask; coarse grid products of western boundary currents tend to underestimate peak values.","“沿着大陆架传播，并在离岸方向迅速衰减的低频海洋波动。”":"\"Low-frequency ocean waves that propagate along the continental shelf and decay rapidly offshore.\"","（必要时还要加入河流与融冰）。副热带下沉气流少云少雨、湿度低并伴随信风，因此蒸发增强。":"(Add rivers and melted ice if necessary). The subtropical downdraft has less clouds, less rain, low humidity, and is accompanied by trade winds, so evaporation is enhanced.",") 成正比。主要由风速、海气温差和稳定度控制；冷干空气越过暖流时最强。":") is directly proportional to. Mainly controlled by wind speed, sea-sea temperature difference and stability; cold and dry air is strongest when it crosses the warm current.","] 成正比。风速和海气湿度差最关键，SST 通过饱和比湿指数式地影响蒸发，大气稳定度和交换系数也重要。":"] proportional to. Wind speed and sea-air humidity difference are the most critical. SST affects evaporation exponentially through saturated specific humidity. Atmospheric stability and exchange coefficient are also important.","><b>副极地环流区</b><span>表层冷且偏淡；永久温跃层较弱，季节温跃层冬季可被侵蚀。降水、融冰和径流使表层低盐，盐度通常随深度增加，盐跃层对密度分层更重要，并可能出现温度逆温。</span></div></div><p class=":"><b>Subpolar Gyre Area</b><span> The surface layer is cold and light; the permanent thermocline is weak, and the seasonal thermocline can be eroded in winter. Precipitation, ice melt, and runoff make the surface layer hyposaline, and salinity usually increases with depth. The halocline is more important for density stratification, and temperature inversions may occur. </span></div></div><p class=","><b>副热带环流区</b><span>表层暖且偏咸；下方存在清晰、较深的永久温跃层，温度随深度快速降低。蒸发占优形成上层盐度极大，向下通常转为较淡的中层水。密度跃层主要受温度控制。</span></div><div class=":"><b>Subtropical circulation area</b><span> The surface layer is warm and salty; there is a clear and deep permanent thermocline below, and the temperature decreases rapidly with depth. Evaporation dominates, forming an upper layer with extremely high salinity, which usually turns to lighter middle water downwards. The pycnocline is primarily controlled by temperature. </span></div><div class=","><b>统一约定</b><span>热通量以“进入海洋为正”，单位为 W m⁻²。表中数值是全球海洋年平均气候态的代表范围，而不是固定常数；不同产品、时期和季节会改变极值，冬季天气过程的瞬时通量可远超年平均。</span></div><div class=":"><b>Uniform agreement</b><span>The heat flux is positive when entering the ocean, and the unit is W m⁻². The values ​​in the table are representative ranges of the annual average climate state of the global ocean, rather than fixed constants; different products, periods and seasons will change the extreme values, and the instantaneous flux of winter weather processes can far exceed the annual average. </span></div><div class=","><b>阅读顺序</b><ol><li>先确认异常场、分析区域和面积权重；</li><li>再读空间型及其对应 PC；</li><li>最后检查方差贡献、模态可分离性与物理证据。</li></ol><a href=":"><b>Reading order</b><ol><li>First confirm the anomaly field, analysis area and area weight; </li><li>Read the spatial type and its corresponding PC; </li><li>Finally check the variance contribution, modal separability and physical evidence. </li></ol><a href=","><b>TIME SCALE</b><strong>Days → Months</strong><p>图示核心范围约为一周至一个月，具体尺度取决于激发机制、地形和层结。</p></article><article class=":"><b>TIME SCALE</b><strong>Days → Months</strong><p>The illustrated core range is approximately one week to one month, depending on the excitation mechanism, topography, and stratification. </p></article><article class=","><blockquote>“沿着大陆架传播，并在离岸方向迅速衰减的低频海洋波动。”</blockquote><footer>专业名称：沿岸俘获波 · Coastally Trapped Waves</footer></article><div class=":"><blockquote>“Low-frequency ocean waves that propagate along the continental shelf and rapidly attenuate offshore.”</blockquote><footer>Professional name: Coastally Trapped Waves · Coastally Trapped Waves</footer></article><div class=","><div><b>经典数据</b><span>NOAA 檀香山站 1612340，2023 年逐小时已验证水位</span></div><div><b>明确约定</b><span>单位 m；MSL 基准面；GMT/UTC；采样间隔 1 h</span></div></div><ul class=":"><div><b>Classic data</b><span>NOAA Honolulu Station 1612340, hourly verified water levels in 2023</span></div><div><b>Clear agreement</b><span>Unit m; MSL datum; GMT/UTC; sampling interval 1 h</span></div></div><ul class=","><div><b>经典数据</b><span>NOAA ERSST v5 月平均海表温度，热带太平洋 1982–2023</span></div><div><b>关键预处理</b><span>1991–2020 月气候态；线性去趋势；√cosφ 面积权重</span></div></div><ul class=":"><div><b>Classic data</b><span>NOAA ERSST v5 monthly mean sea surface temperature, tropical Pacific 1982–2023</span></div><div><b>Key preprocessing</b><span>1991–2020 monthly climate state; linear detrending; √cosφ area weights</span></div></div><ul class=","><div><span>01 · 空间载荷</span><h3>EOF 空间模态</h3></div><span class=":"><div><span>01 · Space load</span><h3>EOF space mode</h3></div><span class=","><div><span>02 · 时间系数</span><h3>PC 标准化时间序列</h3></div><span class=":"><div><span>02 · Time coefficient</span><h3>PC normalized time series</h3></div><span class=","><div><span>03 · 方差贡献</span><div class=":"><div><span>03 · Variance contribution</span><div class=","><div><span>学习进度</span><strong id=":"><div><span>Learning Progress</span><strong id=","><li>示例用 SVD 得到 EOF1 和 PC1，第一模态通常呈现 ENSO 相关的热带太平洋型态。</li><li>EOF 的正负号任意，程序用 Niño‑3.4 区域的空间均值统一符号，便于复现比较。</li><li>EOF 是统计模态，不自动等于单一动力过程；解释时应结合海温、风场和海表高度等证据。</li></ul><details class=":"><li>The example uses SVD to obtain EOF1 and PC1. The first mode usually exhibits the ENSO-related tropical Pacific pattern. </li><li>The sign of EOF is arbitrary, and the program uses the spatial mean of the Niño-3.4 region to unify the sign to facilitate reproduction and comparison. </li><li>EOF is a statistical mode and does not automatically equal a single dynamic process; the interpretation should be combined with evidence such as sea temperature, wind field and sea surface height. </li></ul><details class=","><li>一年记录有利于分离频率接近的分潮；短记录的可分辨分潮更少。</li><li>保留缺测为 NaN，不用长间隔插值制造虚假周期；分析前核查异常值和时间轴。</li><li>输出可作为潮位预测基线；残差适合进一步研究风暴增水或训练深度学习模型。</li></ul><details class=":"><li>One-year records are good for separating tides with close frequency; short records have fewer distinguishable tides. </li><li>Keep missing measurements as NaN, and do not use long-interval interpolation to create false cycles; check outliers and timelines before analysis. </li><li>The output can be used as a baseline for tide level prediction; the residuals are suitable for further studying storm water increase or training deep learning models. </li></ul><details class=","><p><strong>① 风驱通风与俯冲：</strong>表层水在等密度面露头区获得温盐性质，随后在副热带 Ekman 辐合和下沉作用下沿等密度面进入海洋内部；平流把表面浮力强迫形成的暖、轻水体结构输送到主温跃层。</p><p><strong>② 上升流—跨密度扩散平衡：</strong>内部湍混合把热量缓慢向下扩散，同时大尺度上升流把冷的深层水向上输送，两者共同维持温跃层的有限厚度和垂向温度梯度。</p><p class=":"><p><strong>① Wind-driven ventilation and subduction: </strong>Surface water acquires thermohaline properties in the isopycnic surface outcrop area, and then enters the interior of the ocean along the isopycnic surface under the action of subtropical Ekman convergence and subsidence; advection transports the warm and light water structure forced by surface buoyancy to the main thermocline. </p><p><strong>② Upwelling-cross-density diffusion balance:</strong> Internal turbulent mixing slowly diffuses heat downwards, while large-scale upwelling transports cold deep water upwards. The two jointly maintain the limited thickness of the thermocline and the vertical temperature gradient. </p><p class=","><p><strong>简答：</strong>风和波浪维持的混合层通常为数十米，常见约 <strong>25–100 m</strong>，全球定义和观测中常落在 <strong>25–200 m</strong>。冬季表面失热造成对流混合时可加深到数百米；在拉布拉多海、北欧海和南大洋等深对流区，极端情况下可超过 <strong>1000 m</strong>。</p><p class=":"><p><strong>Short answer:</strong> The mixed layer maintained by wind and waves is usually tens of meters, commonly around <strong>25–100 m</strong>, and often falls within <strong>25–200 m</strong> in global definitions and observations. When surface heat loss causes convective mixing in winter, it can deepen to hundreds of meters; in deep convective areas such as the Labrador Sea, the Nordic Sea and the Southern Ocean, it can exceed <strong>1000 m</strong> in extreme cases. </p><p class=","><p>核心项包括：<strong>海表净热通量、水平平流、混合层底的卷入/脱离、垂向湍混合与扩散，以及穿透到混合层底以下的短波辐射</strong>。锋面和涡旋区还应保留次网格或涡旋热输送。</p><div class=":"><p>Core terms include: <strong>Net sea surface heat flux, horizontal advection, entrainment/detachment of the mixed layer bottom, vertical turbulent mixing and diffusion, and shortwave radiation penetrating below the mixed layer bottom</strong>. Frontal and vortex regions should also retain subgrid or vortex heat transport. </p><div class=","><p>下表采用<strong>进入海洋为正</strong>，给出代表性的年平均气候态范围。若课件使用“向上为正”，Q<sub>b</sub>、Q<sub>e</sub> 和 Q<sub>h</sub> 的符号需要整体反转。</p><div class=":"><p>The following table uses <strong>entering the ocean as positive</strong> to give a representative range of annual average climate states. If the courseware uses \"up is positive\", the signs of Q<sub>b</sub>, Q<sub>e</sub> and Q<sub>h</sub> need to be reversed as a whole. </p><div class=","><p>在线预览为图片形式；轻量 PPTX 保留全部 19 页视觉内容，不含内嵌旁白。</p><a class=":"><p>Online preview is in image form; lightweight PPTX retains all 19 pages of visual content without embedded narration. </p><a class=","><p>B站图文教程逐项解释 <code>interval</code>、<code>latitude</code>、<code>start time</code>、<code>TIDECON</code> 与 <code>XOUT</code>；南京大学讲座补充调和分析原理与应用。</p><div class=":"><p>Station B's graphic tutorials explain <code>interval</code>, <code>latitude</code>, <code>start time</code>, <code>TIDECON</code> and <code>XOUT</code> step by step; Nanjing University lectures supplement the principles and applications of harmonic analysis. </p><div class=","><span><b>01</b><strong>整理成长表</strong><small>一列一个变量，一行一次观测</small></span></label><label><input type=":"><span><b>01</b><strong>Organize into a growth table</strong><small>One variable per column, one observation per row</small></span></label><label><input type=","><span><b>02</b><strong>选择图形语法</strong><small>先问关系，再选图形</small></span></label><label><input type=":"><span><b>02</b><strong>Select graphic syntax</strong><small>Ask about relationships first, then select graphics</small></span></label><label><input type=","><span><b>03</b><strong>映射字段</strong><small>维度、数值、颜色各司其职</small></span></label><label><input type=":"><span><b>03</b><strong>Mapped fields</strong><small>Dimensions, values, and colors each perform their own duties</small></span></label><label><input type=","><span><b>04</b><strong>导出与记录</strong><small>保存 SVG、数据版本和映射方案</small></span></label></div></div><div class=":"><span><b>04</b><strong>Export and record</strong><small>Saving SVG, data version and mapping scheme</small></span></label></div></div><div class=","><span>01 · 建框架</span><strong>课程知识地图</strong><p>先定位章节，再建立概念之间的连接。</p><i>打开框架 →</i></a><a class=":"><span>01 · Build a framework</span><strong>Course knowledge map</strong><p>First locate the chapters, and then establish connections between concepts. </p><i>Open frame →</i></a><a class=","><span>02 · 看图像</span><strong>教材逐图解读</strong><p>按海盆、物性和温盐结构筛选 33 幅图。</p><i>进入图解 →</i></a><a class=":"><span>02 · Look at the images</span><strong>Interpret the textbook picture by picture</strong><p>Select 33 pictures according to the ocean basin, physical properties and thermosalinity structure. </p><i>Enter diagram →</i></a><a class=","><span>03 · 做分析</span><strong>T_TIDE · EOF · RAWGraphs</strong><p>从数据、代码到可视表达，完成一个小实验。</p><i>进入实验室 →</i></a><a class=":"><span>03 · Do analysis</span><strong>T_TIDE · EOF · RAWGraphs</strong><p>From data, code to visual expression, complete a small experiment. </p><i>Enter the laboratory →</i></a><a class=","><strong>OCEAN</strong><span>物性 · 过程 · 方法</span></div><span class=":"><strong>OCEAN</strong><span>Physical Properties · Process · Method</span></div><span class=","><summary><span>解释短视频</span><strong>2分50秒理解 EOF 基础</strong></summary><div class=":"><summary><span>Explanation short video</span><strong>Understand the basics of EOF in 2 minutes and 50 seconds</strong></summary><div class=","><summary><span>学习路线</span><strong>先看中文示例，再运行本站程序</strong></summary><div class=":"><summary><span>Learning route</span><strong>First look at the Chinese examples, and then run the program on this site</strong></summary><div class=","><summary>写完了，查看核对要点</summary><div id=":"><summary>After writing, check the key points</summary><div id=","><ul><li><strong>Q<sub>s</sub> 净短波辐射：</strong>太阳高度角（纬度、季节、时刻）是第一控制量；云量与云光学厚度通常决定天气尺度变化，气溶胶、水面反照率和海冰也会调节吸收量。</li><li><strong>Q<sub>b</sub> 净长波辐射：</strong>海表温度通过 σT⁴ 控制海面发射；近海面气温、水汽和云决定大气向下长波。暖而干、少云时海洋长波失热更强。</li><li><strong>Q<sub>e</sub> 潜热通量：</strong>近似与 U[q<sub>s</sub>(SST)−q<sub>a</sub>] 成正比。风速和海气湿度差最关键，SST 通过饱和比湿指数式地影响蒸发，大气稳定度和交换系数也重要。</li><li><strong>Q<sub>h</sub> 感热通量：</strong>近似与 U(SST−T<sub>a</sub>) 成正比。主要由风速、海气温差和稳定度控制；冷干空气越过暖流时最强。</li></ul><div class=":"><ul><li><strong>Q<sub>s</sub> Net shortwave radiation:</strong>Sun altitude angle (latitude, season, time) is the first control variable; cloud amount and cloud optical thickness usually determine weather scale changes, and aerosols, water surface albedo and sea ice will also adjust the amount of absorption. </li><li><strong>Q<sub>b</sub> Net longwave radiation: </strong>Sea surface temperature controls sea surface emission through σT⁴; near sea surface air temperature, water vapor and clouds determine atmospheric downward longwave. Longwave heat loss from the ocean is stronger when it is warm, dry, and less cloudy. </li><li><strong>Q<sub>e</sub> Latent heat flux: </strong>Approximately proportional to U[q<sub>s</sub>(SST)−q<sub>a</sub>]. Wind speed and sea-air humidity difference are the most critical. SST affects evaporation exponentially through saturated specific humidity. Atmospheric stability and exchange coefficient are also important. </li><li><strong>Q<sub>h</sub> Sensible heat flux: </strong>Approximately proportional to U(SST−T<sub>a</sub>). Mainly controlled by wind speed, sea-sea temperature difference and stability; cold and dry air is strongest when it crosses the warm current. </li></ul><div class=",">≈</span><span>描述性物理海洋</span></a><div class=":">≈</span><span>Descriptive physical ocean</span></a><div class=",">▶</span><span>打开视频</span></a><div class=":">▶</span><span>Open video</span></a><div class=",">01</div><h3>明确目标变量</h3><p>区分有效波高、天文潮位、风暴增水和沿岸低频水位异常。</p></article><article class=":">01</div><h3>Clear target variables</h3><p>Distinguish significant wave height, astronomical tide level, storm water increase and coastal low-frequency water level anomalies. </p></article><article class=",">02</div><h3>组织多源观测</h3><p>整合潮位站、浮标、风场、气压、流速和海底地形等资料。</p></article><article class=":">02</div><h3>Organize multi-source observations</h3><p>Integrate data from tide stations, buoys, wind fields, air pressure, current velocity and seafloor topography. </p></article><article class=",">03</div><h3>建立物理基线</h3><p>先分析潮汐周期、传播时滞和天气尺度响应，再训练数据模型。</p></article><article class=":">03</div><h3>Establish a physical baseline</h3><p>First analyze the tidal cycle, propagation delay and weather scale response, and then train the data model. </p></article><article class=",">33 幅</span>，覆盖海盆地形、海水物性与全球温盐密度结构；点击图片可查看原始截图。</p></div><div class=":">33 pictures</span>, covering ocean basin shape, seawater physical properties and global temperature and salt density structure; click on the picture to view the original screenshot. </p></div><div class=",">保存并下一题</button></div><p class=":">Save and next question</button></div><p class=",">北大西洋平均比太平洋更咸还是更淡？为什么？</strong></span></summary><div class=":">The North Atlantic is saltier or lighter on average than the Pacific Ocean? Why? </strong></span></summary><div class=",">北太平洋副热带与副极地海区的典型温盐剖面有何不同？</strong></span></summary><div class=":">What are the differences between typical thermohaline profiles in the North Pacific subtropical and subpolar sea areas? </strong></span></summary><div class=",">潮汐分潮</button><button data-raw-example=":">Tidal fraction</button><button data-raw-example=",">出门票</a></div><div class=":">Tickets</a></div><div class=",">从海盆地形、温盐密度到海气交换、潮汐与大尺度环流。这里把教材图解、课堂问答、可复现实验和专题故事组织成一套可检索、可练习、可继续生长的课程系统。</p><div class=":">From ocean basin shape and thermohaline density to air-sea exchange, tides and large-scale circulation. Here, textbook illustrations, classroom questions and answers, reproducible experiments and special stories are organized into a course system that is searchable, practiceable and sustainable. </p><div class=",">打开 RAWGraphs 2.0</a><a class=":">Open RAWGraphs 2.0</a><a class=",">方法实验室</a><a href=":">Method Laboratory</a><a href=",">风混合层通常多深？冷却驱动时可达到多深？</strong></span></summary><div class=":">How deep is the wind mixing layer typically? How deep can it be when cooling the drive? </strong></span></summary><div class=",">概念</span><h4 id=":">Concept</span><h4 id=",">官方学习中心</a><a class=":">Official Learning Center</a><a class=",">海盆地形</span><span class=":">Ocean basin shape</span><span class=",">海气交换</span><span class=":">Sea and air exchange</span><span class=",">海洋中净蒸发占优的主要区域在哪里？</strong></span></summary><div class=":">Where are the main areas in the ocean where net evaporation dominates? </strong></span></summary><div class=",">混合层热收支包括哪些关键项？</strong></span></summary><div class=":">What are the key items included in the mixed layer heat budget? </strong></span></summary><div class=",">教材图解</a><a href=":">Textbook illustrations</a><a href=",">教学示意</span></div><canvas id=":">Teaching instructions</span></div><canvas id=",">进入知识外脑</a><a class=":">Enter the knowledge outside the brain</a><a class=",">均值 0 · 标准差 1</span></div><canvas id=":">Mean 0 · Standard deviation 1</span></div><canvas id=",">课程首页</a><a href=":">Course Home Page</a><a href=",">来源页面限制第三方网页内嵌，链接将在新窗口打开。</div></div></article><article class=":">The source page restricts embedding of third-party web pages, and the link will open in a new window. </div></div></article><article class=",">哪些海区夏冬差异最大？哪些区域季节变化最小？</strong></span></summary><div class=":">Which sea areas have the greatest differences between summer and winter? Which areas have the smallest seasonal changes? </strong></span></summary><div class=",">三个相邻但不同的概念</h2></div><p>“海面有起伏”并不意味着它们都属于通常所说的表面波。区分时间尺度、空间尺度和主要控制机制，才能为数据采样和模型设计选择合适的目标。</p></div><div class=":">Three adjacent but different concepts</h2></div><p>\"The sea surface has undulations\" does not mean that they are all commonly known as surface waves. Distinguishing between temporal scales, spatial scales, and primary control mechanisms enables the selection of appropriate targets for data sampling and model design. </p></div><div class=",">上一题</button><button class=":">Previous question</button><button class=",">视频第一节解释 EOF、空间模态与时间系数；看完再进入标准 EOF、面积权重和 North 检验。</p><a class=":">The first section of the video explains EOF, spatial modes and time coefficients; watch it before proceeding to the standard EOF, area weight and North test. </p><a class=",">水团 T–S</button></div><div class=":">Water mass T–S</button></div><div class=",">四个分量的典型量级、最大与最小中心在哪里？</strong></span></summary><div class=":">Where are the typical magnitudes, maximum and minimum centers of the four components? </strong></span></summary><div class=",">四个热收支分量分别由什么因素决定？</strong></span></summary><div class=":">What factors determine the four heat budget components? </strong></span></summary><div class=",">图源：Talley 等《Descriptive Physical Oceanography: An Introduction》第六版及课程截图。下方文字为学习性释义，不替代原书图注；公开使用时请保留书目信息并注意版权范围。</div><div class=":">Image source: Talley et al.'s \"Descriptive Physical Oceanography: An Introduction\" sixth edition and course screenshots. The text below is a learning explanation and does not replace the original book illustrations. Please retain the bibliographic information and pay attention to the scope of copyright when using it publicly. </div><div class=",">完成今日出门票</a></div></div><div class=":">Complete issuing tickets today</a></div></div><div class=",">维持温跃层的两个主要过程是什么？</strong></span></summary><div class=":">What are the two main processes that maintain the thermocline? </strong></span></summary><div class=",">位相 <output id=":">Phase <output id=",">温盐密度</span><span class=":">Temperature and salt density</span><span class=",">我的回答</label><textarea id=":">My answer</label><textarea id=",">下载 ERSST v5 NetCDF</a><a href=":">Download ERSST v5 NetCDF</a><a href=",">下载 T_TIDE v1.5beta</a><a href=":">Download T_TIDE v1.5beta</a><a href=",">下载示例水位 CSV</a><a href=":">Download sample water level CSV</a><a href=",">在 B 站打开完整课程（5节） →</a></details><div class=":">Open the complete course (5 lessons) at Station B →</a></details><div class=",">知识框架</a><a href=":">Knowledge Framework</a><a href=",">中</button><button type=":">中</button><button type=",">重新开始</button></aside><article class=":">Start again</button></aside><article class=",">B站 · 调和分析讲座</a></div></div></details><div class=":">Bilibili · Harmonic Analysis Lecture</a></div></div></details><div class=",">B站 · T_TIDE 工具包教程</a><a href=":">Bilibili · T_TIDE toolkit tutorial</a><a href=",">Course questions</div><h2>上层海洋与海气热收支</h2></div><p>以下内容对应课件中的 9 个问题。答案先给可直接复述的结论，再说明物理原因、数量级与限定条件。</p></div><div class=":">Course questions</div><h2>Upper ocean and air-sea heat budget</h2></div><p>The following content corresponds to the 9 questions in the courseware. The answer first gives a conclusion that can be directly restated, and then explains the physical reasons, orders of magnitude, and limiting conditions. </p></div><div class=",">Descriptive Physical Oceanography</div><h1>描述性物理海洋<span>课程网站 · 我的知识外脑</span></h1><p class=":">Descriptive Physical Oceanography</div><h1>Descriptive Physical Oceanography<span>Course Website · My Knowledge Outside the Brain</span></h1><p class=",">EOF 方差贡献</button><button data-raw-example=":">EOF variance contribution</button><button data-raw-example=",">EOF 可视实验</a><a href=":">EOF visual experiment</a><a href=",">EOF1 · 盆地尺度同号模态</strong></div><div class=":">EOF1 · Basin scale same sign mode</strong></div><div class=",">External video</div><h3>沿岸俘获波视频</h3><p>先观看配套视频建立传播图像，再用右侧课件核对方程和边界条件。</p><a class=":">External video</div><h3>Coastal captured wave video</h3><p>First watch the supporting video to establish the propagation image, and then use the courseware on the right to check the equations and boundary conditions. </p><a class=",">FIVE QUESTIONS · AUTO SCROLL</span><h3>EOF 五问五答</h3></div><div class=":">FIVE QUESTIONS · AUTO SCROLL</span><h3>EOF Five Questions and Five Answers</h3></div><div class=",">Knowledge atlas</div><h2>物理海洋学框架</h2></div><p>脑图被整理成可阅读的专题目录。选择左侧主题，可查看核心概念以及它与东海近岸研究的联系。</p></div><div class=":">Knowledge atlas</div><h2>Physical Oceanography Framework</h2></div><p>The brain maps are organized into readable thematic directories. Select the topic on the left to view the core concept and its connection to East China Sea offshore research. </p></div><div class=",">Learning dashboard</div><h2>今天从哪里开始？</h2></div><p>不需要从头滚到尾。选择一个学习入口，每个模块只在需要时展开；完成后用出门票把知识写回自己的长期记忆。</p></div><div class=":">Learning dashboard</div><h2>Where to start today? </h2></div><p>No need to scroll from beginning to end. Choose a learning portal and expand each module only when needed; use the ticket to write the knowledge back into your long-term memory after completion. </p></div><div class=",">MATLAB</span></div><h3>T_TIDE 潮汐调和分析</h3><p>把连续水位序列表示为多个已知天文频率的正弦分量之和，估计每个分潮的振幅和相位，并将重建潮位与非潮残差分离。</p><div class=":">MATLAB</span></div><h3>T_TIDE tidal harmonic analysis</h3><p>Represents the continuous water level sequence as the sum of sinusoidal components of multiple known astronomical frequencies, estimates the amplitude and phase of each tidal component, and separates the reconstructed tidal level from the non-tidal residuals. </p><div class=",">Method laboratory</div><h2>经典分析方法与可复现实验</h2></div><p>先用物理可解释的经典方法提取潮汐分量和主导时空模态，再把结果作为深度学习的基线、特征或残差目标。下面的程序、数据和工具均可直接下载。</p></div><div class=":">Method laboratory</div><h2>Classic analysis methods and reproducible experiments</h2></div><p>First use physically interpretable classical methods to extract tidal components and dominant spatiotemporal modes, and then use the results as the baseline, features or residual targets of deep learning. The programs, data and tools below are available for direct download. </p></div><div class=",">MIT OCW · 温跃层理论</a><a href=":">MIT OCW · Thermocline Theory</a><a href=",">NOAA · 海洋温度结构</a><a href=":">NOAA · Ocean Temperature Structure</a><a href=",">NOAA · 混合层定义</a><a href=":">NOAA · Mixed Layer Definition</a><a href=",">NOAA 产品说明</a><a href=":">NOAA Product Description</a><a href=",">NOAA GFDL · 海洋混合</a><a href=":">NOAA GFDL · Ocean Mix</a><a href=",">NOAA PMEL · 海表通量</a><a href=":">NOAA PMEL · Ocean Surface Flux</a><a href=",">Python</span></div><h3>EOF 经验正交分解</h3><p>把去季节、去趋势后的海洋时空异常场分解为正交空间模态 EOF 与对应时间系数 PC，按方差贡献率识别主导变化结构。</p><div class=":">Python</span></div><h3>EOF Empirical Orthogonal Decomposition</h3><p>Decompose the deseasonal and detrended ocean space-time anomaly field into orthogonal spatial mode EOF and corresponding time coefficient PC, and identify the dominant change structure according to the variance contribution rate. </p><div class=",">Research workflow</div><h2>东海近岸研究路径</h2></div><p>围绕海浪与潮位预测，将观测资料、动力机制和数据驱动方法放在同一条分析链上。深度学习模型的采样间隔与预报时长应匹配目标过程的物理尺度。</p></div><div class=":">Research workflow</div><h2>East China Sea offshore research path</h2></div><p> Focusing on wave and tide level prediction, put observation data, dynamic mechanisms and data-driven methods in the same analysis chain. The sampling interval and forecast duration of the deep learning model should match the physical scale of the target process. </p></div><div class=",">Retrieval practice</div><h2>出门票</h2></div><p>离开页面前，用 3–5 分钟回答一题。先写自己的答案，再查看核对要点；回答记录只保存在当前浏览器，不会上传。</p></div><div class=":">Retrieval practice</div><h2>Remit tickets</h2></div><p>Before leaving the page, take 3–5 minutes to answer one question. Write your own answer first, and then check the check points; the answer record is only saved in the current browser and will not be uploaded. </p></div><div class=",">Story · Core concept</div><h2>沿岸俘获波</h2></div><p>Coastally Trapped Waves，简称 CTWs。它们受海岸边界、地球自转和大陆架地形共同约束，主要沿海岸方向传播，可表现为沿岸水位、流速和温度的低频变化。</p></div><div class=":">Story · Core concept</div><h2>Coastally Trapped Waves</h2></div><p>Coastally Trapped Waves, referred to as CTWs. They are jointly constrained by the coastal boundary, the earth's rotation and the continental shelf topography. They mainly propagate along the coast and can be manifested as low-frequency changes in coastal water levels, current speeds and temperatures. </p></div><div class=",">Story · Watch & read</div><h2>视频与 19 页课件</h2></div><p>视频用于快速建立直观认识，课件继续展开控制方程、模态结构、层结与摩擦效应；两者共同组成沿岸俘获波 Story 的学习材料。</p></div><div class=":">Story · Watch & read</div><h2>Video and 19 pages of courseware</h2></div><p>The video is used to quickly establish intuitive understanding, and the courseware continues to expand on the governing equations, modal structure, stratification and friction effects; the two together form the learning materials for the coastal captured wave Story. </p></div><div class=",">Surface gravity waves</div><h3>表面重力波</h3><p><strong>研究量：</strong>有效波高、周期和波向。通常对应风浪与涌浪，是近岸海浪预测的直接对象。</p></article><article class=":">Surface gravity waves</div><h3>Surface gravity waves</h3><p><strong>Research amount:</strong> Effective wave height, period and wave direction. Usually corresponds to wind waves and swells, and is the direct object of nearshore wave prediction. </p></article><article class=",">Surface tides</div><h3>表面潮汐</h3><p><strong>研究量：</strong>潮位和潮流。天文潮可通过分潮进行调和分析与预报。</p></article><article class=":">Surface tides</div><h3>Surface tides</h3><p><strong>Research volume:</strong> Tide levels and currents. Astronomical tides can be coordinated, analyzed and forecasted through tidal divisions. </p></article><article class=",">Textbook figure guide</div><h2>教材图解</h2></div><p>把合成截图中的每一幅图拆开解释。当前已整理 <span class=":">Textbook figure guide</div><h2>Textbook figure guide</h2></div><p>Take apart and explain each picture in the combined screenshots. Currently organized <span class=",">Visual thinking lab</div><h2>RAWGraphs 学习模块</h2></div><p>把分析结果从“数据表”变成“可讨论的图”。选择一个海洋学示例，按四步完成字段映射；示例只演示表达方式，不代替正式统计检验。</p></div><div class=":">Visual thinking lab</div><h2>RAWGraphs learning module</h2></div><p>Transform the analysis results from \"data tables\" into \"discussable graphs\". Select an oceanographic example and complete field mapping in four steps; the example only demonstrates the expression and does not replace formal statistical testing. </p></div><div class=",">WHOI OAFlux · 热通量气候态</a><a href=":">WHOI OAFlux·Heat flux climate state</a><a href=","▶ 播放位相":"▶ Play phase","❚❚ 暂停":"❚❚ Pause","01 · 建框架":"01·Build a framework","01 · 空间载荷":"01 · Space load","02 · 看图像":"02 · View image","02 · 时间系数":"02 · Time coefficient","03 · 方差贡献":"03 · Variance contribution","03 · 做分析":"03 · Do analysis","04 · 读 Story":"04 · Read Story","① 风驱通风与俯冲：":"① Wind-driven ventilation and subduction:","1929年大浅滩浊流证据":"1929 Grand Banks Turbidity Current Evidence","1991–2020 月气候态；线性去趋势；√cosφ 面积权重":"1991–2020 monthly climate state; linear detrending; √cosφ area weight","② 上升流—跨密度扩散平衡：":"② Upwelling-cross-density diffusion balance:","2分50秒理解 EOF 基础":"2 minutes and 50 seconds to understand the basics of EOF","30角秒分辨率约为1 km量级，但不同区域的真实信息仍取决于船测与重力反演覆盖。":"The resolution of 30 arc seconds is about 1 km, but the real information in different areas still depends on ship measurement and gravity inversion coverage.","33 幅":"33 pieces","按海盆、物性和温盐结构筛选 33 幅图。":"Filter 33 images by ocean basin, physical properties, and thermohaline structure.","把分析结果从“数据表”变成“可讨论的图”。选择一个海洋学示例，按四步完成字段映射；示例只演示表达方式，不代替正式统计检验。":"Transform analysis results from \"data tables\" into \"discussable graphs.\" Select an oceanographic example and complete field mapping in four steps; the example only demonstrates the expression and does not replace formal statistical testing.","把概念、尺度、视频和 19 页课件串成完整专题。":"Concepts, scales, videos, and 19 pages of courseware are strung together into a complete feature.","把合成截图中的每一幅图拆开解释。当前已整理":"Break down each image in the composite screenshot and explain it. Currently sorted","把连续水位序列表示为多个已知天文频率的正弦分量之和，估计每个分潮的振幅和相位，并将重建潮位与非潮残差分离。":"The continuous water level sequence is represented as the sum of sinusoidal components of multiple known astronomical frequencies, the amplitude and phase of each tide are estimated, and the reconstructed tidal levels are separated from the non-tidal residuals.","把去季节、去趋势后的海洋时空异常场分解为正交空间模态 EOF 与对应时间系数 PC，按方差贡献率识别主导变化结构。":"Decompose the deseasonalized and detrended ocean spatiotemporal anomaly field into the orthogonal spatial mode EOF and the corresponding time coefficient PC, and identify the dominant change structure according to the variance contribution rate.","保存 SVG、数据版本和映射方案":"Save SVG, data version and mapping scheme","保存并下一题":"Save and next question","保留缺测为 NaN，不用长间隔插值制造虚假周期；分析前核查异常值和时间轴。":"Keep missing measurements as NaN, and do not use long-interval interpolation to create false cycles; check outliers and timelines before analysis.","北冰洋海盆地形":"arctic ocean basin shape","北冰洋由广阔浅陆架、中央深海盆和多条海岭组成，并通过白令海峡、弗拉姆海峡及北欧海与其他大洋交换。":"The Arctic Ocean consists of a broad shallow continental shelf, a central deep-sea basin and multiple ocean ridges, and exchanges with other oceans through the Bering Strait, Fram Strait and the Nordic Sea.","北大西洋表层和中层总体较咸；深层分布受北大西洋深水影响。":"The surface and middle layers of the North Atlantic are generally saltier; the deep distribution is affected by the deep water of the North Atlantic.","北大西洋平均比太平洋更咸还是更淡？为什么？":"Is the North Atlantic saltier or lighter on average than the Pacific Ocean? Why?","北大西洋平均更咸。":"The North Atlantic is saltier on average.","北太平洋副热带与副极地海区的典型温盐剖面有何不同？":"What are the differences between typical thermohaline profiles in the North Pacific subtropical and subpolar sea areas?","北太平洋高纬降水多且无强深水形成，表层盐度较低。":"There is a lot of precipitation at high latitudes in the North Pacific, no strong deep water is formed, and the surface salinity is low.","北太平洋中层约数百米还常见北太平洋中层水的盐度极小；实际剖面随季节、经度和水团路径变化。":"It is also common to see very little salinity in the mid-level water of the North Pacific at about a few hundred meters; the actual profile varies with season, longitude, and water mass path.","北印度洋季风风向半年反转，使上层环流季节性强，是风驱海洋响应的典型案例。":"The half-year reversal of the monsoon wind direction in the North Indian Ocean makes the upper-level circulation seasonally strong, which is a typical case of wind-driven ocean response.","本题为空，未保存。":"This question is empty and has not been saved.","比较不同深度水团时优先使用位温或保守温度，并采用TEOS‑10一致处理。":"When comparing water masses at different depths, it is preferred to use potential temperature or conservative temperature, and use TEOS‑10 for consistent processing.","比较不同站点的主要分潮，适合用分组条形图或多集条形图。相位是圆周量，不应和振幅共用同一线性轴。":"To compare major trends across sites, use a grouped bar chart or a multi-set bar chart. Phase is a circular quantity and should not share the same linear axis as amplitude.","边界层":"boundary layer","表层混合层与底边界层":"Surface mixed layer and bottom boundary layer","表层冷且偏淡；永久温跃层较弱，季节温跃层冬季可被侵蚀。降水、融冰和径流使表层低盐，盐度通常随深度增加，盐跃层对密度分层更重要，并可能出现温度逆温。":"The surface layer is cold and light; the permanent thermocline is weak, and the seasonal thermocline can be eroded in winter. Precipitation, ice melt, and runoff make the surface layer hyposaline, and salinity usually increases with depth. The halocline is more important for density stratification, and temperature inversions may occur.","表层密度由温度与盐度共同决定，总体从暖热带向冷高纬增大；北大西洋与南极周边存在适合深水形成的高密度表层水。":"Surface density is determined by both temperature and salinity, and generally increases from the warm tropics to cold high latitudes; high-density surface water suitable for the formation of deep water exists around the North Atlantic and Antarctica.","表层暖且偏咸；下方存在清晰、较深的永久温跃层，温度随深度快速降低。蒸发占优形成上层盐度极大，向下通常转为较淡的中层水。密度跃层主要受温度控制。":"The surface layer is warm and salty; there is a clear and deep permanent thermocline below, and the temperature decreases rapidly with depth. Evaporation dominates, forming an upper layer with extremely high salinity, which usually turns to lighter middle water downwards. The pycnocline is primarily controlled by temperature.","表层水在等密度面露头区获得温盐性质，随后在副热带 Ekman 辐合和下沉作用下沿等密度面进入海洋内部；平流把表面浮力强迫形成的暖、轻水体结构输送到主温跃层。":"Surface water acquires thermohaline properties in the isopycnic surface outcrop area, and then enters the interior of the ocean along the isopycnic surface under the action of subtropical Ekman convergence and subsidence; advection transports the warm and light water structure forced by surface buoyancy to the main thermocline.","表层温跃层中温度下降常使声速降低。":"The temperature drop in the surface thermocline often reduces the speed of sound.","表层盐度反映蒸发、降水、径流、结冰融冰和环流的综合作用：副热带蒸发带高盐，赤道多雨带和高纬海区偏淡。":"Surface salinity reflects the combined effects of evaporation, precipitation, runoff, ice and melt, and circulation: the subtropical evaporative zone is high in salinity, while the equatorial rainy belt and high-latitude sea areas are relatively salty.","表观光学量包括上/下行辐照度、反射率和PAR，受太阳角度与海况影响。":"Apparent optical quantities include up/downwell irradiance, reflectivity and PAR, which are affected by sun angle and sea conditions.","表面潮汐":"surface tide","表面通量、平流、卷入与混合":"Surface flux, advection, entrainment and mixing","表面重力波":"surface gravity waves","冰间湖是高纬深水形成与海气交换热点，也展示了表面边界条件如何改变水团。":"Polynyas are hot spots for deep water formation and air-sea exchange at high latitudes, and also demonstrate how surface boundary conditions change water masses.","冰间湖是海冰覆盖区持续或反复出现的开阔水面，可由风驱冰外输的潜热过程或海洋向上供热的感热过程维持。":"Polynya is an open water surface that occurs continuously or repeatedly in sea ice-covered areas. It can be maintained by the latent heat process of wind-driven ice export or the sensible heat process of upward heating by the ocean.","波流相互作用":"wave current interaction","播放位相变化":"Play phase changes","不需要从头滚到尾。选择一个学习入口，每个模块只在需要时展开；完成后用出门票把知识写回自己的长期记忆。":"No need to scroll from beginning to end. Choose a learning portal and expand each module only when needed; use the ticket to write the knowledge back into your long-term memory after completion.","不一定。应查看相邻特征值是否可分离，例如使用 North 误差估计，并对时间段、区域、掩膜和预处理做敏感性试验。":"Not necessarily. You should look to see if adjacent feature values ​​are separable, for example using the North error estimate, and do sensitivity tests on time periods, regions, masks and pre-processing.","布设水声观测或解释远距离声信号时，需要同期温盐剖面计算声速。":"When deploying hydroacoustic observations or interpreting long-distance acoustic signals, it is necessary to calculate the sound velocity from temperature and salt profiles in the same period.","参考经典 EOF 展示的阅读顺序，把空间型、主成分和方差贡献放在同一工作台。下图是可交互的教学示意，不是 ERSSTv5 的计算结果；正式分析请运行上方 Python 程序。":"Referring to the reading order of the classic EOF presentation, place spatial types, principal components, and variance contributions on the same workbench. The picture below is an interactive teaching diagram, not the calculation result of ERSSTv5; for formal analysis, please run the Python program above.","参考压力与位密度":"Reference pressure and bit density","层结":"stratification","层结海洋中的内部波动":"Internal fluctuations in stratified oceans","查看核心程序":"View core programs","潮位、内波和层结分析必须从温盐计算密度，不能只看温度剖面。":"Tide level, internal wave and stratification analysis must calculate density from thermosalinity and cannot just look at temperature profiles.","潮位和潮流。天文潮可通过分潮进行调和分析与预报。":"Tide level and current. Astronomical tides can be coordinated, analyzed and forecasted through tidal divisions.","潮位站、浮标与 ADCP":"Tide stations, buoys and ADCP","潮汐分潮":"tidal equinox","潮汐分潮振幅比较":"Comparison of tidal amplitudes","潮汐与环流":"Tides and Circulation","潮汐与水位":"Tides and water levels","潮汐重建、预报与非潮残差":"Tidal reconstruction, forecasting and non-tidal residuals","尺度分析":"scale analysis","出门票":"Exit Ticket","处理剖面数据时应保留pressure与depth的区别，尤其在高精度动力高度计算中。":"The distinction between pressure and depth should be retained when processing profile data, especially in high-precision dynamic altitude calculations.","从地转流、Ekman 输运到涡旋、锋面和湍流混合，理解海洋中的能量与物质输运。":"Understand energy and material transport in the ocean, from geostrophic currents and Ekman transport to eddies, fronts, and turbulent mixing.","从海盆地形、海水物性到潮汐与时空模态，用图解、实验和 Story 建立可持续生长的知识外脑。":"From ocean basin topography and physical properties of seawater to tides and spatio-temporal modes, use illustrations, experiments and stories to build a sustainable growing knowledge brain.","从海盆地形、温盐密度到海气交换、潮汐与大尺度环流。这里把教材图解、课堂问答、可复现实验和专题故事组织成一套可检索、可练习、可继续生长的课程系统。":"From ocean basin shape and thermohaline density to air-sea exchange, tides and large-scale circulation. Here, textbook illustrations, classroom questions and answers, reproducible experiments and special stories are organized into a course system that is searchable, practiceable and sustainable.","从混合层到永久温跃层，连接海表强迫、温盐剖面、季节循环和水团通风。":"From the mixed layer to the permanent thermocline, connecting sea surface forcing, thermohaline profiles, seasonal cycles and water mass ventilation.","从空间模态到时间系数":"From spatial modes to temporal coefficients","从数据、代码到可视表达，完成一个小实验。":"From data, code to visual expression, complete a small experiment.","打开 RAWGraphs 2.0":"Open RAWGraphs 2.0","打开框架 →":"Open frame →","打开视频":"Open video","大部分深海平原坡度很小，较大坡度集中在大陆坡、海沟、洋中脊和海山附近，说明海底动力边界具有强烈空间非均匀性。":"Most of the abyssal plains have very small slopes, and larger slopes are concentrated near continental slopes, trenches, mid-ocean ridges and seamounts, indicating that the submarine dynamic boundary has strong spatial heterogeneity.","大尺度环流":"large-scale circulation","大陆架浅而缓，大陆坡陡，坡脚外侧可形成大陆隆。":"The continental shelf is shallow and gentle, the continental slope is steep, and a continental rise can be formed outside the slope foot.","大西洋20°W温盐密度断面":"Atlantic Ocean 20°W Thermohaline Density Section","大西洋海盆地形":"atlantic basin shape","大西洋经向翻转环流与南北向海盆形状相关，可与太平洋的深水更新形成对照。":"The Atlantic meridional overturning circulation is associated with the north-south basin shape and can be contrasted with deep-water renewal in the Pacific.","大西洋整体比太平洋更咸，与跨盆水汽输送和海盆淡水收支有关。":"The Atlantic Ocean is overall saltier than the Pacific Ocean, which is related to inter-basin water vapor transport and the freshwater budget of the ocean basin.","大西洋中脊大致位于海盆中央，海底年龄和地形在两侧较对称；多数边缘为被动大陆边缘，宽陆架与大陆隆较发育。":"The Mid-Atlantic Ridge is roughly located in the center of the ocean basin, and the seafloor age and topography are relatively symmetrical on both sides; most edges are passive continental margins, with wide continental shelves and continental rises.","大洋中央连续的浅色带对应洋中脊；狭长的深色带多对应海沟。":"The continuous light-colored bands in the center of the ocean correspond to mid-ocean ridges; the narrow, dark-colored bands mostly correspond to trenches.","单位 m；MSL 基准面；GMT/UTC；采样间隔 1 h":"Unit m; MSL datum; GMT/UTC; sampling interval 1 h","淡水收支":"fresh water balance","导出与记录":"Export and record","地球表面的高程—水深分布":"Elevation-water depth distribution on the earth's surface","地转平衡与风生环流":"Geostrophic balance and wind-induced circulation","的符号需要整体反转。":"The sign of needs to be reversed overall.","等密度线显示海水密度随盐度增加而增大、随温度升高而减小。典型海洋温盐范围位于图中狭窄区域。":"Isopycnal lines show that the density of seawater increases with increasing salinity and decreases with increasing temperature. Typical ocean temperature and salinity ranges lie within the narrow region of the figure.","低分辨率插值会平滑陡峭地形，低估局地坡度。":"Low-resolution interpolation smoothes steep terrain and underestimates local slope.","低频传播、离岸衰减与模态结构":"Low frequency propagation, offshore attenuation and modal structure","低频水位":"low frequency water level","低纬、少云的热带—副热带海洋，约 +250～+300":"Low-latitude, sparsely cloudy tropical-subtropical ocean, about +250~+300","低纬暖池和赤道附近开阔海域的年循环通常较弱；深层海洋季节变化更小。但赤道冷舌、上升流区和季风控制区是低纬例外。":"Annual cycles in low-latitude warm pools and open oceans near the equator are generally weaker; seasonal changes in the deep ocean are smaller. However, the equatorial cold tongue, upwelling area and monsoon control area are exceptions at low latitudes.","低纬温度效应占主导，暖水密度低。":"The temperature effect at low latitudes dominates, and the density of warm water is low.","第 1 题":"Question 1","第 2 题":"Question 2","第 3 题":"Question 3","第 4 题":"Question 4","第 5 题":"Question 5","第2章 · 海盆地形":"Chapter 2 · Ocean basin topography","第3章 · 海水物性":"Chapter 3 · Physical Properties of Seawater","第二模态用东西反号结构说明 EOF 的正交约束；它可能反映传播、位相差或多个过程的混合。":"The second mode illustrates the orthogonality constraints of the EOF with an east-west sign structure; it may reflect propagation, phase differences, or a mixture of multiple processes.","第三模态展示赤道带与两侧副热带的反号关系，提醒我们高阶模态更需要稳定性检验和独立证据。":"The third mode shows the opposite sign relationship between the equatorial zone and the subtropical zones on both sides, reminding us that higher-order modes require more stability testing and independent evidence.","第一模态强调赤道中东太平洋的盆地尺度变化，可用于建立 ENSO 型空间结构的直觉。":"The first mode emphasizes basin-scale variability in the equatorial central-eastern Pacific and can be used to build intuition for ENSO-type spatial structure.","典型年平均范围":"Typical annual average range","点击查看原图 ↗":"View original figure ↗","电导率同时受温度、盐度和压力影响，不能直接等同于盐度。":"Conductivity is affected by temperature, salinity and pressure at the same time and cannot be directly equated to salinity.","顶层大气信号比水体目标信号可高一个数量级以上。":"The top atmospheric signal can be more than an order of magnitude higher than the water target signal.","东北太平洋剖面展示实测温度T、位温θ、电导率和盐度的垂向变化。位温去除了水团绝热升降造成的压缩增温。":"The Northeast Pacific profile shows vertical changes in measured temperature T, potential temperature θ, conductivity and salinity. The potential temperature removes the compression heating caused by the adiabatic rise and fall of the water mass.","东部边界上升流使同纬度海温偏低。":"The upwelling at the eastern boundary makes the sea temperature at the same latitude lower.","东海近岸高浑浊水会降低遥感反射率解释的通用性，算法需分水体类型验证。":"Highly turbid water in the East China Sea will reduce the versatility of remote sensing reflectivity interpretation, and the algorithm needs to be verified by water body type.","东海近岸研究路径":"East China Sea offshore research path","东海近岸研究最相关的是大陆架宽度、陆坡位置和海槽，它们约束潮波传播及跨陆架交换。":"The most relevant for offshore studies in the East China Sea are continental shelf width, continental slope position, and troughs, which constrain tidal wave propagation and cross-shelf exchange.","东海近岸盐度受长江径流和季风强烈调制，是密度分层、锋面和水位响应的重要预测因子。":"Nearshore salinity in the East China Sea is strongly modulated by Yangtze River runoff and monsoons, and is an important predictor of density stratification, frontal and water level responses.","东海通过琉球岛弧与西太平洋相连，黑潮沿陆坡流动，地形对陆架交换至关重要。":"The East China Sea is connected to the Western Pacific through the Ryukyu Island Arc, and the Kuroshio Current flows along the continental slope. The topography is crucial to continental shelf exchange.","东海位于宽广大陆架上，水深和坡度控制潮汐、陆架波、近岸环流及海浪变形。":"The East China Sea is located on a broad continental shelf, and water depth and slope control tides, shelf waves, nearshore circulation and wave deformation.","东太平洋海隆扩张快，轴部较宽缓；大西洋中脊扩张慢，中央裂谷和断裂地貌更粗糙。扩张速率改变岩浆供给、断层活动和海底起伏。":"The East Pacific Rise expands rapidly, with a wider and gentler axis; the Mid-Atlantic Ridge expands slowly, and the central rift and fault landforms are rougher. Expansion rates alter magma supply, fault activity, and seafloor relief.","东太平洋海隆是快速扩张中心。":"The East Pacific Rise is a center of rapid expansion.","短波辐射 Qs":"Shortwave radiation Qs","二者共同形成声速最小层，即深海声道轴。":"The two together form the minimum layer of sound speed, which is the deep-sea acoustic channel axis.","方差贡献高就说明模态稳定吗？":"Does a high variance contribution mean that the mode is stable?","方法实验室":"Methods laboratory","分潮振幅、相位与潮汐预报":"Tidal Amplitude, Phase and Tidal Forecast","分量":"weight","风暴与波浪增水":"Storms and waves increase water","风和波浪维持的混合层通常为数十米，常见约":"The mixed layer maintained by wind and waves is usually tens of meters, commonly about","风混合、对流混合与深度判据":"Wind mixing, convective mixing and depth criterion","风混合层通常多深？冷却驱动时可达到多深？":"How deep is the wind mixing layer typically? How deep can it be when cooling the drive?","风浪、涌浪与近岸变形":"Wind waves, swells and nearshore deformation","风速、海气湿度差和温差":"Wind speed, sea-air humidity difference and temperature difference","符号":"symbol","副极地环流区":"subpolar gyre area","副热带环流区":"subtropical circulation area","副热带与副极地结构差异":"Differences in structure between subtropical and subpolar regions","概念":"concept","感热冰间湖：潮汐或地形混合把较暖深层水带到表面并融冰。":"Thermal polynya: Tidal or topographic mixing brings warmer deep water to the surface and melts the ice.","感热通量：":"Sensible heat flux:","高纬盐度差异变得关键：北太平洋因较淡而比北大西洋难形成深水。":"Differences in salinity at high latitudes become critical: the North Pacific is shallower, making it harder for deep water to form than the North Atlantic.","高盐海水的最大密度温度低于其冰点，因此海水通常先结冰，不会像淡水湖那样在4°C出现密度最大层。":"The maximum density temperature of hypersaline seawater is below its freezing point, so seawater usually freezes first and does not have a maximum density layer at 4°C like freshwater lakes.","给模式设置地形或解释观测站代表性时，应区分陆架、陆坡和深海盆地，不能只用“平均海深”。":"When setting terrain for the model or interpreting the representativeness of observation stations, continental shelves, continental slopes and deep-sea basins should be distinguished, and \"mean sea depth\" cannot be used alone.","根据站点关系和空间网格选择时序网络、图网络或 Transformer。":"Choose a temporal network, graph network, or Transformer based on site relationships and spatial grid.","更长记录更容易区分频率接近的分潮，并更可靠地估计振幅和相位。":"Longer records make it easier to distinguish between tides with close frequency and provide more reliable estimates of amplitude and phase.","构造年龄影响海底热流和盆地深度，但近岸潮汐与陆架波更直接受现代地形控制。":"Tectonic age affects seafloor heat flow and basin depth, but nearshore tides and shelf waves are more directly controlled by modern topography.","固有光学性质主要是吸收和散射，与外部光场无关。":"The intrinsic optical properties are mainly absorption and scattering and have nothing to do with the external light field.","关键预处理":"Key preprocessing","观测与模型":"Observations and Models","官方学习中心":"Official Learning Center","光谱衰减与光在海水中的穿透":"Spectral attenuation and light penetration in seawater","海表净热通量、水平平流、混合层底的卷入/脱离、垂向湍混合与扩散，以及穿透到混合层底以下的短波辐射":"Net surface heat flux, horizontal advection, entrainment/detachment of the mixed layer, vertical turbulent mixing and diffusion, and shortwave radiation penetrating below the mixed layer","海表温度年较差":"Annual range of sea surface temperature","海表温度通过 σT⁴ 控制海面发射；近海面气温、水汽和云决定大气向下长波。暖而干、少云时海洋长波失热更强。":"Sea surface temperature controls sea surface emission through σT⁴; near-sea surface air temperature, water vapor and clouds determine atmospheric downward long waves. Longwave heat loss from the ocean is stronger when it is warm, dry, and less cloudy.","海表温度总体随纬度降低，但受西边界流、上升流、海陆分布和季节影响而出现强烈经向与东西向差异。":"Sea surface temperature generally decreases with latitude, but there are strong meridional and east-west differences due to the influence of the western boundary current, upwelling, sea and land distribution and season.","海表压力通常记为0 dbar的海洋学表压。":"Sea surface pressure is usually expressed as the oceanographic gauge pressure of 0 dbar.","海冰、极夜、天气与后勤限制使历史观测稀疏。":"Sea ice, polar night, weather and logistical constraints have made historical observations sparse.","海冰改变动量和热盐交换；窄海峡输运对北冰洋淡水收支和全球气候具有放大作用。":"Sea ice changes momentum and heat and salt exchange; narrow strait transport has an amplifying effect on the Arctic Ocean freshwater budget and global climate.","海底粗糙度会影响深海混合、内潮散射和声传播，是能量耗散参数化的重要背景。":"Seafloor roughness affects deep-sea mixing, internal tide scattering, and acoustic propagation and is an important background for the parameterization of energy dissipation.","海沟数量少于太平洋，但局地仍有岛弧和俯冲系统。":"There are fewer trenches than in the Pacific Ocean, but there are still local island arcs and subduction systems.","海浪、潮流和耦合模拟":"Wave, tidal current and coupling simulation","海岭与海峡会引导或收缩流路并增强混合。":"Ridges and straits can channel or constrict flow paths and enhance mixing.","海面风场、海表高度与温度":"Sea surface wind field, sea surface height and temperature","海盆地貌单元与实测剖面":"Ocean basin topographic units and measured profiles","海盆地形":"ocean basin shape","海盆两侧对称扩张是板块分离的重要证据。":"Symmetrical expansion on both sides of the ocean basin is important evidence of plate separation.","海气交换":"air-sea exchange","海气热通量四分量":"Four components of air-sea heat flux","海气相互作用":"air-sea interaction","海山链记录板块越过热点的运动历史。":"Seamount chains record the history of plate movement across hot spots.","海水光学过程框架":"Seawater optical process framework","海水声速由温度、盐度和压力共同决定：升温、增盐与增压通常都会提高声速，但温度随深度降低和压力随深度增加相互竞争。":"The speed of sound in seawater is determined by temperature, salinity, and pressure: warming, salinity, and pressurization generally increase the speed of sound, but the decrease in temperature with depth and the increase in pressure with depth compete with each other.","海水物性":"Seawater physical properties","海水性质":"Sea water properties","海温、湿度、云与红外发射":"Sea temperature, humidity, clouds and infrared emissions","海温锋面与近岸风、波浪和海气通量耦合，适合与潮位、海浪预测共同作为环境特征。":"Sea temperature fronts are coupled with nearshore winds, waves and air-sea fluxes, and are suitable to be used as environmental features together with tide levels and wave predictions.","海洋波动":"ocean waves","海洋岩石圈年龄":"Ocean lithosphere age","海洋中的声线折射":"Sound refraction in the ocean","海洋中净蒸发占优的主要区域在哪里？":"Where are the main areas in the ocean where net evaporation dominates?","海洋中压力随深度近似线性增加；常用经验是1 dbar约对应1 m水深，但精确换算还受纬度、重力和密度影响。":"Pressure in the ocean increases approximately linearly with depth; common experience is that 1 dbar corresponds to approximately 1 m water depth, but the precise conversion is also affected by latitude, gravity and density.","和":"and","和 Q":"and Q","和通量符号约定。":"and flux sign conventions.","核心项包括：":"Core items include:","黑线表示板块边界；年龄带的偏移可识别转换断层。":"Black lines indicate plate boundaries; shifts in age bands identify transform faults.","横轴":"horizontal axis","横轴 / 纵轴":"Horizontal axis / vertical axis","红光被水快速吸收，只能穿透很浅。":"Red light is quickly absorbed by water and can only penetrate very shallowly.","红外SST分辨率高但受云遮挡。":"Infrared SST has high resolution but is blocked by clouds.","环流与混合":"Circulation and Mixing","混合层":"mixed layer","混合层、温盐结构与温跃层":"Mixed layer, thermohaline structure and thermocline","混合层热收支":"mixed layer heat budget","混合层热收支包括哪些关键项？":"What are the key items included in the mixed layer heat budget?","混合层深度必须附带判据，例如相对 10 m 的温度差或密度差阈值。东海陆架还受水深限制，浅海中可直接混合至海底。":"The mixed layer depth must be accompanied by criteria such as a temperature difference or density difference threshold relative to 10 m. The East China Sea continental shelf is also limited by water depth, and water in shallow seas can be mixed directly to the bottom of the sea.","基础理论":"basic theory","即使水团在海表具有固定温度0°C和盐度35，随压力增加其原位密度仍会显著增大，这是海水可压缩性的结果。":"Even if the water mass has a fixed temperature of 0°C and a salinity of 35 at the sea surface, its in-situ density will still increase significantly as the pressure increases, which is a result of the compressibility of seawater.","计算浮力频率、地转流和水团密度时，应使用位密度或TEOS‑10中适当变量。":"When calculating buoyancy frequency, geostrophic currents, and water mass density, potential density or appropriate variables from TEOS‑10 should be used.","记录长度决定频率分辨率，近似为 1/T。":"The record length determines the frequency resolution, which is approximately 1/T.","季风造成强季节非平稳性，使用EOF或机器学习时应先判断是否需要分季节建模。":"Monsoons cause strong seasonal non-stationarity. When using EOF or machine learning, you should first determine whether seasonal modeling is needed.","季节温跃层、主温跃层与通风":"Seasonal Thermocline, Main Thermocline and Ventilation","季节信号随深度快速衰减，深海几乎感受不到年周期。":"The seasonal signal decays rapidly with depth, and the annual cycle is almost undetectable in the deep ocean.","季节性海冰区和高纬冬季，年平均常低于 +50":"In seasonal sea ice areas and high latitude winters, the annual average is often below +50","简答：":"Short answer:","建立物理基线":"Establish a physical baseline","较重海水位于较轻海水下方，微小垂向位移会产生回复力。":"The heavier seawater is located below the lighter seawater, and small vertical displacements will generate restoring forces.","教材图解":"Textbook illustrations","教材图解分类":"Classification of textbook illustrations","教材逐图解读":"Picture-by-picture interpretation of textbooks","教学示意":"Teaching instructions","结果验证":"Result verification","解释":"explain","解释短视频":"short explanation video","解释需要结合风场、海表高度、时间系数、敏感性试验和独立证据。":"Interpretation requires a combination of wind fields, sea surface height, time factors, sensitivity testing and independent evidence.","今天从哪里开始？":"Where to start today?","近岸观测与海缆数据出现突变时，需要区分水动力异常、沉积物过程与仪器故障。":"When there are sudden changes in nearshore observation and submarine cable data, it is necessary to distinguish hydrodynamic anomalies, sediment processes and instrument failures.","近岸气溶胶复杂、邻近效应强，通常比开阔海更难校正。":"Nearshore aerosols are complex and have strong proximity effects, which are generally more difficult to correct than those in the open ocean.","近岸深度学习若要保持物理一致性，可把由温盐计算的密度或浮力通量作为辅助变量。":"To maintain physical consistency in nearshore deep learning, density or buoyancy flux calculated from thermohaline can be used as auxiliary variables.","近似与 U(SST−T":"Approximately U(SST−T","近似与 U[q":"Approximately U[q","近洋中脊的年龄接近0，平行于脊轴的年龄带记录海底扩张。":"The age of the near-mid-ocean ridge is close to zero, and the age band parallel to the ridge axis records seafloor spreading.","进入海洋为正":"Entering the ocean is positive","进入实验室 →":"Enter the laboratory →","进入图解 →":"Enter the diagram →","进入知识外脑":"Enter the knowledge brain","经典分析方法与可复现实验":"Classic analysis methods and reproducible experiments","经典数据":"Classic data","经向断面显示暖水集中于上层、永久温跃层下方为冷深水；盐度和密度结构记录副热带蒸发、高纬深水形成及南北半球水团交换。":"The meridional section shows that warm water is concentrated in the upper layer, and cold deep water is below the permanent thermocline; the salinity and density structure record subtropical evaporation, the formation of high-latitude deep water, and the exchange of water masses in the northern and southern hemispheres.","净短波辐射：":"Net shortwave radiation:","净长波辐射：":"Net longwave radiation:","局地高盐或低盐水可沿等密度面向海洋内部俯冲传播。":"Local high salinity or low salinity can propagate along the isopycnal subduction into the ocean interior.","均值 0 · 标准差 1":"mean 0 · standard deviation 1","开阔水增强海气热量、水汽和动量交换。":"Open water enhances air-sea heat, water vapor and momentum exchange.","开展时空预测":"Carry out space-time prediction","课程首页":"Course Home Page","课程网站 · 我的知识外脑":"Course Site · My External Knowledge Brain","课程知识地图":"Course knowledge map","课程知识结构示意":"Course knowledge structure diagram","课件缩略图":"Courseware thumbnail","控制方程":"Governing equations","控制量是淡水收支":"The control quantity is the fresh water balance","跨越很大深度范围时，固定参考压力的位密度面可能偏离中性面。":"Across a large depth range, the potential density plane for a fixed reference pressure may deviate from the neutral plane.","快、慢速扩张洋中脊地貌":"Fast and slow spreading mid-ocean ridge landforms","来源页面限制第三方网页内嵌，链接将在新窗口打开。":"The source page restricts embedding of third-party web pages, and the link will open in a new window.","蓝色越深通常表示水深越大，浅蓝色沿大陆边缘勾勒出大陆架。":"Darker blue generally indicates greater water depth, and lighter blue outlines the continental shelf along the edge of the continent.","冷舌或沿岸上升流上空暖空气平流区，可接近 0 或略为正":"The advection area of warm air above the cold tongue or coastal upwelling can be close to 0 or slightly positive","离开页面前，用 3–5 分钟回答一题。先写自己的答案，再查看核对要点；回答记录只保存在当前浏览器，不会上传。":"Before leaving the page, take 3–5 minutes to answer one question. Write your own answer first, and then check the check points; the answer record is only saved in the current browser and will not be uploaded.","利用卫星海色研究近岸水体时，需同时考虑悬沙、叶绿素、CDOM和大气校正。":"When using satellite sea color to study coastal water bodies, suspended sand, chlorophyll, CDOM and atmospheric correction need to be considered at the same time.","两类冰间湖形成机制":"Two types of polynya formation mechanisms","两水团混合路径与弯曲等密度线也体现海水状态方程非线性。":"The mixing path of the two water masses and the curved isopycnal lines also reflect the nonlinearity of the seawater equation of state.","两图尺度相同，约1000 km，便于直接比较地貌纹理。":"The scale of the two maps is the same, about 1000 km, which facilitates direct comparison of landform textures.","两者研究变量和采样策略不同，不能仅凭海面起伏混为一谈。":"The two research variables and sampling strategies are different and cannot be confused simply based on sea surface fluctuations.","流场对波传播与能量的调制":"Modulation of wave propagation and energy by flow fields","陆地邻近、季风和西边界流区季节变化可显著增强。":"Seasonal variability can be significantly enhanced in the land adjacent, monsoon, and western boundary current regions.","陆块阻挡较少是形成强大绕极流的几何条件。":"Less obstruction by land masses is a geometric condition for the formation of strong circumpolar currents.","陆缘和板块边界形成连续高坡度带。":"Continental margins and plate boundaries form continuous high-slope zones.","路径取决于初始发射角和整个声速剖面，而不只是水深。":"The path depends on the initial launch angle and the entire sound velocity profile, not just the water depth.","罗蒙诺索夫海岭等把中央盆地分隔成多个子海盆。":"The Lomonosov Ridge and others divide the central basin into multiple sub-basins.","每 8 秒自动切换；悬停、聚焦或使用键盘时暂停。":"Automatically switches every 8 seconds; pauses on hover, focus, or keyboard use.","密度而非单独温度决定浮力、层结与对流潜势。":"Density, not temperature alone, determines buoyancy, stratification, and convective potential.","密跃层及其纬向差异":"Mycline and its zonal differences","密跃层深度影响内波相速、混合层热容量与上层海洋可预报性，应作为模型分层特征。":"The depth of the mycline affects the internal wave phase velocity, mixed layer heat capacity and upper ocean predictability, and should be used as a model layering feature.","密跃层是密度随深度快速增加的层。热带—副热带上层密跃层强而浅，高纬水柱表层密度更高、上下密度差较小，永久密跃层通常较弱。":"The mycline is a layer whose density increases rapidly with depth. The upper mycline in the tropics and subtropics is strong but shallow. The surface density of the water column at high latitudes is higher and the density difference between the upper and lower parts is small. The permanent mycline is usually weak.","密跃层通常与温跃层相关，但降水、径流或盐跃层也可主导密度变化。":"The mycline is usually associated with the thermocline, but precipitation, runoff, or the halocline can also dominate density changes.","密跃层以下深海密度变化小，却仍保持稳定层结。":"The density of the deep ocean below the mycline changes little, but still maintains stable stratification.","面积分布呈明显“双峰”：陆地集中在接近海平面的正高程，海底集中在约4 km深处，中间的大陆坡面积较小。":"The area distribution shows an obvious \"double peak\": the land is concentrated at a positive elevation close to sea level, the seafloor is concentrated at a depth of about 4 km, and the continental slope in the middle has a smaller area.","描述天体引潮力以及风、气压和波浪共同造成的水位变化，并通过调和分析分离天文潮与非潮残差。":"Describe the water level changes caused by the tidal force of celestial bodies and wind, air pressure and waves, and separate the astronomical tidal and non-tidal residuals through harmonic analysis.","描述性物理海洋":"Descriptive Physical Oceanography","描述性物理海洋 · 课程网站":"Descriptive Physical Oceanography · Course Site","描述性物理海洋课程网站：以教材图解、课程问答、经典分析方法、数据可视化和专题 Story 建立个人知识外脑。":"Descriptive Physics Ocean Course Website: Use textbook illustrations, course questions and answers, classic analysis methods, data visualization and special stories to build a personal knowledge brain.","敏感性试验、独立资料与物理一致性":"Sensitivity testing, independent data and physical consistency","明确目标变量":"Identify the target variable","明确约定":"clear agreement","模型切分应覆盖完整季节循环；若训练与测试季节分布不同，可能产生虚假的预测优势。":"Model segmentation should cover the complete seasonal cycle; if the training and testing seasonal distributions are different, false prediction advantages may occur.","哪些海区夏冬差异最大？哪些区域季节变化最小？":"Which sea areas have the greatest difference between summer and winter? Which areas have the smallest seasonal changes?","南大洋环绕南极洲连续分布，德雷克海峡连接各大洋，使南极绕极流能够沿纬向贯通；海冰和冰间湖呈强季节变化。":"The Southern Ocean is continuously distributed around Antarctica, and the Drake Strait connects all oceans, allowing the Antarctic Circumpolar Current to penetrate along the zonal direction; sea ice and polynya show strong seasonal changes.","南大洋是全球海洋热量、碳和深层水交换的枢纽，可作为东海陆架局地过程的尺度对照。":"The Southern Ocean is a hub for global ocean heat, carbon and deep water exchange and can serve as a scale comparison of local processes on the East China Sea shelf.","南大洋与南极洲周边地形":"The terrain surrounding the Southern Ocean and Antarctica","南极底层水从南方进入最深处，表现为低温高密度水。":"The Antarctic bottom water enters the deepest part from the south and appears as low-temperature and high-density water.","脑图被整理成可阅读的专题目录。选择左侧主题，可查看核心概念以及它与东海近岸研究的联系。":"Brain maps are organized into readable thematic directories. Select the topic on the left to view the core concept and its connection to East China Sea offshore research.","内波与内潮":"Internal waves and internal tides","内部湍混合把热量缓慢向下扩散，同时大尺度上升流把冷的深层水向上输送，两者共同维持温跃层的有限厚度和垂向温度梯度。":"Internal turbulent mixing slowly diffuses heat downward, while large-scale upwelling transports cold deep water upward. The two together maintain the limited thickness and vertical temperature gradient of the thermocline.","能量沿岸传播，离岸结构受陆架宽度、坡度和变形半径控制。":"Energy propagates along the coast, and offshore structure is controlled by shelf width, slope, and deformation radius.","年较差在中高纬和西北大洋最大，在热带开阔海洋较小；其空间分布由季节性辐射、混合层深度、海流和海冰共同控制。":"The annual range is largest in mid-high latitudes and the northwest ocean, and smaller in the tropical open ocean; its spatial distribution is jointly controlled by seasonal radiation, mixed layer depth, ocean currents, and sea ice.","纽芬兰以南地震触发沉积物重力流，沿坡向深海传播并先后切断海底电缆；电缆断裂时间提供了浊流移动的间接观测。":"Earthquakes south of Newfoundland triggered sediment gravity currents that propagated along the slope to the deep sea and successively severed submarine cables; the time of cable rupture provided indirect observations of turbidity current movement.","欧亚大陆边缘拥有全球最宽广的陆架之一。":"The edge of Eurasia has one of the widest continental shelves in the world.","判断稳定性需把水团绝热移到共同参考压力。":"Determining stability requires moving the water mass adiabatically to a common reference pressure.","坡度决定地形波、内潮和沿岸俘获波的模态结构，制作东海地形特征时应保留陆坡梯度。":"Slope determines the modal structure of topographic waves, internal tides and coastal captured waves, and the continental slope gradient should be retained when creating topographic features of the East China Sea.","其中 Q":"Among them Q","气象强迫和破碎带辐射应力":"Meteorological forcing and fracture zone radiation stress","前三个 EOF 模态的示意方差贡献":"Schematic variance contributions of the first three EOF modes","前者受海岸、地球自转、层结和陆架地形约束，沿岸传播并向外海衰减。":"The former is constrained by the coast, Earth's rotation, stratification and continental shelf topography, and propagates along the coast and attenuates to the open sea.","潜热冰间湖：风把新生海冰移走，持续结冰和盐析促成致密水。":"Latent thermal polynya: Winds move young sea ice away, and continued freezing and salting promote dense water.","潜热通量：":"Latent heat flux:","潜热与感热":"Latent heat and sensible heat","浅层声源可能形成表面声道或出现声影区。":"Shallow sound sources may form surface channels or sound shadow areas.","清洁大洋水在蓝—绿波段衰减最弱、穿透最深；浑浊近岸水因颗粒与有色物质吸收散射增强，透光深度显著减小。":"Clean ocean water has the weakest attenuation and deepest penetration in the blue-green band; turbid nearshore water has enhanced absorption and scattering by particles and colored substances, and the light transmission depth is significantly reduced.","清洁水体的透光窗口偏蓝，浑浊水体常向绿光移动。":"The light-transmitting windows of clean water bodies tend to be bluer, while turbid water bodies tend to move toward green light.","区分有效波高、天文潮位、风暴增水和沿岸低频水位异常。":"Distinguish between significant wave height, astronomical tide level, storm water increase and coastal low-frequency water level anomalies.","去季节突出非季节异常，去趋势避免长期变暖垄断方差；经纬网格再乘 √cosφ，可使不同纬度格点按代表面积进入协方差。是否执行每一步取决于研究问题。":"Remove seasons to highlight non-seasonal anomalies, and remove trends to avoid long-term warming monopolizing the variance; multiplying the longitude and latitude grids by √cosφ can make different latitude grid points enter the covariance according to their representative areas. Whether or not each step is performed depends on the research question.","全部图解":"All illustrations","全球地形与海底地形":"Global Topography and Undersea Topography","全球冬季表层密度":"Global winter surface density","全球冬季表层盐度":"Global winter surface salinity","全球冬季海表温度":"Global winter sea surface temperatures","全球高程—水深图把陆地、陆架、深海盆地、洋中脊和海沟放在同一垂向尺度上。海洋并不是平坦水盆，而是由板块构造塑造的起伏系统。":"The global elevation-bathymetry map places land, continental shelves, deep-sea basins, mid-ocean ridges, and trenches on the same vertical scale. The ocean is not a flat basin but an undulating system shaped by plate tectonics.","全球海底平均坡度":"Global mean seafloor slope","缺测、非平稳性和气象残差仍会影响结果，不能只看记录长度。":"Missing measurements, non-stationarity and meteorological residuals will still affect the results, and we cannot just look at the record length.","热带暖池最暖，高纬与海冰边缘最冷。":"Tropical warm pools are the warmest, while high latitudes and sea ice edges are the coldest.","热带暖水层薄，温跃层随纬度和环流起伏。":"The tropical warm water layer is thin, and the thermocline fluctuates with latitude and circulation.","热带太平洋 EOF 空间模态教学示意图":"Tropical Pacific EOF spatial mode teaching diagram","热通量以“进入海洋为正”，单位为 W m⁻²。表中数值是全球海洋年平均气候态的代表范围，而不是固定常数；不同产品、时期和季节会改变极值，冬季天气过程的瞬时通量可远超年平均。":"Heat flux is positive “into the ocean” and has units of W m⁻². The values ​​in the table are representative ranges of the annual average climate state of the global ocean, rather than fixed constants; different products, periods and seasons will change the extreme values, and the instantaneous flux of winter weather processes can far exceed the annual average.","融合现场观测、遥感、数值模式与深度学习，构建可验证的近岸海洋预测系统。":"Integrate on-site observations, remote sensing, numerical models and deep learning to build a verifiable nearshore ocean prediction system.","三个相邻但不同的概念":"Three adjacent but different concepts","上层等温线倾斜与环流和风驱温跃层有关。":"The tilt of the upper-level isotherm is related to circulation and wind-driven thermocline.","上层海洋结构":"upper ocean structure","上层海洋与海气热收支":"Upper ocean and air-sea heat budget","上层密度梯度大，N通常较高，对应较短浮力周期。":"The density gradient in the upper layer is large, and N is usually higher, corresponding to a shorter buoyancy period.","上一个问题":"Previous question","上一题":"Previous question","上一页":"Previous page","深层水团分析仍需写明参考压力，并注意非线性状态方程。":"Deep water mass analysis still needs to indicate the reference pressure and pay attention to the nonlinear state equation.","深层水团沿全球翻转环流路径逐渐变老并发生性质改变。":"Deep water masses gradually age and change properties along global overturning circulation paths.","深层水主要经南部通道更新，北印度洋没有高纬深水源。":"Deep water is mainly renewed through the southern channel, and there are no high-latitude deep water sources in the northern Indian Ocean.","深层压力效应占优，声速随深度再次升高。":"The deep pressure effect dominates, and the sound speed increases again with depth.","深层T通常略高于θ，差值随压力增大。":"Deep T is usually slightly higher than θ, and the difference increases with pressure.","深度学习":"deep learning","深度学习使用SST时应记录传感器、昼夜、云掩膜和观测深度定义，防止数据源切换造成偏差。":"When using SST for deep learning, the sensor, day and night, cloud mask and observation depth definitions should be recorded to prevent deviations caused by data source switching.","深海密度变化缓慢，N较低，层结较弱。":"Deep sea density changes slowly, N is low, and stratification is weak.","深海平原整体平坦，但其上分布海山和深海丘陵。":"The abyssal plain is generally flat, but is dotted with seamounts and abyssal hills.","深海声道中的声线围绕声速最小层上下振荡。":"The sound rays in the deep-sea vocal tract oscillate up and down around the layer of minimum sound speed.","深于8 km的海沟只占极小面积，不能代表典型海底。":"Trench deeper than 8 km only occupies a very small area and cannot represent a typical seafloor.","声速的温盐压贡献":"Thermohaline pressure contribution to the speed of sound","声速剖面决定声呐和水声通信路径，也影响ADCP及声学观测的传播修正。":"The sound velocity profile determines the sonar and hydroacoustic communication paths, and also affects the propagation correction of ADCP and acoustic observations.","声线按照声速梯度连续折射，并趋向声速较低的区域；声速极小层可把声能限制在深海声道内传播很远。":"Sound rays are continuously refracted according to the sound speed gradient and tend to areas with lower sound speeds; the minimum sound speed layer can limit the sound energy to propagate very far in the deep-sea sound channel.","湿润多云的 ITCZ 或寒冷高纬，约 −20～−50":"Humid and cloudy ITCZ or cold high latitudes, about −20 to −50","时序网络、图网络与 Transformer":"Sequential Network, Graph Network and Transformer","实测温度、位温、电导率与盐度剖面":"Measured temperature, potential temperature, conductivity and salinity profiles","使用海色产品训练模型时，应保留质量标志并检查近岸异常，避免把大气残差当作海洋变化。":"When using sea-color products to train models, quality flags should be retained and nearshore anomalies should be checked to avoid treating atmospheric residuals as ocean changes.","示例":"Example","示例用 SVD 得到 EOF1 和 PC1，第一模态通常呈现 ENSO 相关的热带太平洋型态。":"The example uses SVD to obtain EOF1 and PC1. The first mode usually exhibits the ENSO-related tropical Pacific pattern.","示意图与南太平洋实测水深剖面展示从大陆架、陆坡到深海平原、洋中脊、海山和海沟的完整海盆结构。":"Schematic diagrams and measured bathymetric profiles of the South Pacific illustrate the complete ocean basin structure from continental shelves and continental slopes to abyssal plains, mid-ocean ridges, seamounts and trenches.","视频第一节解释 EOF、空间模态与时间系数；看完再进入标准 EOF、面积权重和 North 检验。":"The first section of the video explains EOF, spatial modes and time coefficients; after watching it, you can proceed to the standard EOF, area weight and North test.","视频用于快速建立直观认识，课件继续展开控制方程、模态结构、层结与摩擦效应；两者共同组成沿岸俘获波 Story 的学习材料。":"The video is used to quickly establish intuitive understanding, and the courseware continues to expand on the governing equations, modal structures, stratification and friction effects; both of which together form the learning materials for the Story of Coastal Captured Waves.","视频与 19 页课件":"Video and 19 pages of courseware","输出可作为潮位预测基线；残差适合进一步研究风暴增水或训练深度学习模型。":"The output can be used as a baseline for tide level prediction; the residuals are suitable for further studying storm surges or training deep learning models.","数据分析方法":"Data analysis methods","数据练习来源：NOAA ERSSTv5 月平均海表温度；本交互仅演示 EOF 的结构与阅读方法，不显示未经本站程序计算验证的统计数值。":"Data exercise source: NOAA ERSSTv5 monthly mean sea surface temperature; this interaction only demonstrates the structure and reading method of EOF, and does not display statistical values that have not been calculated and verified by the program on this site.","数值 / 颜色":"Value/Color","数值模式":"Numeric mode","双峰结构反映大陆地壳与大洋地壳厚度、密度和等静力状态的差异。":"The bimodal structure reflects the differences in thickness, density, and isostatic state between continental and oceanic crust.","水团 T–S":"Water mass T–S","水团升降会发生绝热压缩或膨胀，原位温度因此随压力改变。":"Adiabatic compression or expansion occurs as the water mass rises and falls, and the in-situ temperature therefore changes with pressure.","水团温盐关系":"Water mass temperature and salt relationship","顺序断缆证明扰动不是同一时刻的远程地震破坏，而是沿海底传播。":"Sequential cable breaks prove that the disturbance is not a remote earthquake damage at the same time, but propagates along the seafloor.","四个分量的典型量级、最大与最小中心在哪里？":"Where are the typical magnitudes, maximum and minimum centers of the four components?","四个热收支分量分别由什么因素决定？":"What factors determine the four heat budget components?","它把随时间变化的空间异常场表示为空间模态 EOF 与时间系数 PC 的乘积之和。每对 EOF–PC 描述一种统计协变结构，而不是自动命名一个物理过程。":"It represents the time-varying spatial anomaly field as the sum of the products of the spatial mode EOF and the time coefficient PC. Each EOF–PC pair describes a statistical covariant structure rather than automatically naming a physical process.","太平洋150°W温盐密度断面":"Pacific Ocean 150°W Thermohaline Density Section","太平洋断面可作为ENSO EOF空间模态的三维背景，但二维EOF不能直接代表完整翻转环流。":"The Pacific Ocean section can be used as the three-dimensional background of the ENSO EOF spatial mode, but the two-dimensional EOF cannot directly represent the complete overturning circulation.","太平洋海盆地形":"pacific ocean basin shape","太平洋面积最大且边缘海沟密集，东太平洋海隆偏东，西部发育岛弧—海沟系统和众多边缘海，海盆结构明显不对称。":"The Pacific Ocean has the largest area and dense marginal trenches. The East Pacific Rise is eastward, and island arc-trench systems and numerous marginal seas develop in the west. The basin structure is obviously asymmetrical.","太平洋上层温跃层显著，赤道和副热带结构受风驱环流控制；北太平洋表层偏淡，深水主要从南方和其他海盆输入。":"The upper Pacific Ocean has a prominent thermocline, and the equatorial and subtropical structures are controlled by wind-driven circulation; the surface of the North Pacific is relatively light, and deep water is mainly imported from the south and other ocean basins.","太平洋西部保留较老洋壳，周缘海沟对应俯冲消亡边界。":"The western Pacific retains older oceanic crust, and the peripheral trenches correspond to the subduction and extinction boundaries.","太阳高度、云、反照率与穿透":"Sun height, clouds, albedo and penetration","太阳高度角（纬度、季节、时刻）是第一控制量；云量与云光学厚度通常决定天气尺度变化，气溶胶、水面反照率和海冰也会调节吸收量。":"The solar altitude angle (latitude, season, time) is the first control variable; cloud cover and cloud optical thickness usually determine weather scale changes, and aerosols, water surface albedo and sea ice will also adjust the absorption amount.","太阳入射、海况和海底边界与海水固有光学性质共同决定辐射场，并表现为卫星可观测的表观光学性质。":"Solar incidence, sea conditions, seafloor boundaries, and the inherent optical properties of seawater jointly determine the radiation field, which is manifested as apparent optical properties observable by satellites.","题目进度":"Question progress","天文潮":"Astronomical tide","通过辐射和湍流通量描述海洋与大气之间的热量交换，并建立混合层热收支。":"Describe the heat exchange between the ocean and the atmosphere through radiative and turbulent fluxes and establish the mixed layer heat budget.","同一水团相对于海表0 dbar和深层4000 dbar计算的位密度不同，说明位密度必须明确参考压力。":"The calculated potential density of the same water mass relative to 0 dbar at the sea surface and 4000 dbar at depth is different, indicating that the potential density must clearly refer to the pressure.","统一约定":"unified agreement","图示北太平洋站位从海面到约6000 m基本呈直线。":"The figure shows that the North Pacific station is basically a straight line from the sea surface to about 6000 m.","图示核心范围约为一周至一个月，具体尺度取决于激发机制、地形和层结。":"The illustrated core ranges from approximately one week to one month, depending on the excitation mechanism, topography, and stratification.","图示平均陆地高度约743 m，平均海深约3734 m，中位海深约4083 m。":"The figure shows that the average land height is about 743 m, the average sea depth is about 3734 m, and the median sea depth is about 4083 m.","图形":"graphics","图源：Talley 等《Descriptive Physical Oceanography: An Introduction》第六版及课程截图。下方文字为学习性释义，不替代原书图注；公开使用时请保留书目信息并注意版权范围。":"Source: Talley et al.'s \"Descriptive Physical Oceanography: An Introduction\" sixth edition and course screenshots. The text below is a learning explanation and does not replace the original book illustrations. Please retain the bibliographic information and pay attention to the scope of copyright when using it publicly.","图中110、30、10、1 m曲线说明不同水质下光谱能量随深度迅速改变。":"The 110, 30, 10, and 1 m curves in the figure illustrate that the spectral energy changes rapidly with depth under different water qualities.","图中不同纬度剖面显示相同深度范围内密度梯度差异。":"The different latitude profiles in the figure show differences in density gradients within the same depth range.","图中从海表约1028 kg m⁻³增至5000 dbar处约1050 kg m⁻³。":"The figure increases from about 1028 kg m⁻³ at the sea surface to about 1050 kg m⁻³ at 5000 dbar.","图中关于季风的手写提示是课堂注释，不是原图数据层。":"The handwritten reminder about the monsoon in the picture is a class annotation, not the data layer of the original picture.","图中亮暗表示平均坡度而非水深，不能把陡坡误读为深水。":"The light and dark in the picture represent the average slope rather than the water depth, so steep slopes cannot be mistaken for deep water.","拖动位相会同步改变左侧空间异常的强度与符号；EOF 与 PC 同时反号不会改变重建场。":"Dragging the phase will synchronously change the intensity and sign of the left spatial anomaly; inverting the signs of EOF and PC at the same time will not change the reconstructed field.","湾流、黑潮及干燥强风海域，约 −150～−250；冬季月平均可超过 −300":"In the Gulf Stream, Kuroshio and dry strong wind sea areas, it is about −150 to −250; the monthly average in winter can exceed −300","湾流和黑潮把暖水向极输送，形成密集等温线和强锋面。":"The Gulf Stream and Kuroshio transport warm water poleward, forming dense isotherms and strong fronts.","湾流和黑潮冬季冷空气爆发区，年平均约 −40～−80，天气尺度可低于 −100":"The winter cold air outbreak area of the Gulf Stream and Kuroshio has an annual average of about −40 to −80 degrees Celsius, and the weather scale can be lower than −100 degrees Celsius.","完成今日出门票":"Complete the ticket issue today","微波SST可穿云，但分辨率较粗，近岸和强降雨条件下误差较大。":"Microwave SST can penetrate clouds, but the resolution is coarse and the error is large under near-shore and heavy rainfall conditions.","围绕海浪与潮位预测，将观测资料、动力机制和数据驱动方法放在同一条分析链上。深度学习模型的采样间隔与预报时长应匹配目标过程的物理尺度。":"Focusing on wave and tide level prediction, observation data, dynamic mechanisms and data-driven methods are put on the same analysis chain. The sampling interval and forecast duration of the deep learning model should match the physical scale of the target process.","维持温跃层的两个主要过程是什么？":"What are the two main processes that maintain the thermocline?","维度、数值、颜色各司其职":"Dimensions, values, and colors each perform their own duties","卫星传感器接收的总辐亮度大部分来自大气散射，真正携带海色信息的离水辐亮度只占很小部分，因此大气校正是海色反演的核心。":"Most of the total radiance received by satellite sensors comes from atmospheric scattering, and the water-leaving radiance that actually carries sea color information accounts for only a small part. Therefore, atmospheric correction is the core of sea color inversion.","卫星海表温度视图":"Satellite sea surface temperature view","卫星接收辐亮度与大气校正":"Satellite reception radiance and atmospheric correction","卫星提供准全球、高空间分辨率的SST，能显示锋面、涡旋和上升流；不同传感器在分辨率、云影响和覆盖范围之间存在权衡。":"Satellites provide quasi-global, high spatial resolution SST that can display fronts, eddies and upwellings; there are trade-offs between different sensors in resolution, cloud influence and coverage.","卫星只测“表皮”或次表层温度，与浮标深度温度并非完全相同。":"Satellites only measure the \"surface\" or subsurface temperature, which is not exactly the same as the depth temperature of the buoy.","为什么 EOF1 不能直接等同于 ENSO？":"Why can't EOF1 be directly equated to ENSO?","为什么比较不同深度水团时，原位温度往往不如位温合适？":"Why is potential temperature usually more suitable than in-situ temperature when comparing water masses at different depths?","为什么常先去季节、去趋势并做面积权重？":"Why do we often remove seasons, remove trends and do area weighting first?","为什么一年的逐小时水位记录通常比一个月记录更适合分离相近分潮？":"Why are hourly water level records over a year generally better suited to separating similar equinoxes than monthly records?","位密度随深度增加表示稳定层结；Brunt–Väisälä频率N量化垂向位移后水团的回复振荡速度。":"The increase in potential density with depth indicates stable stratification; the Brunt–Väisälä frequency N quantifies the recovery oscillation speed of the water mass after vertical displacement.","位密度与浮力频率剖面":"Bit Density and Buoyancy Frequency Profile","位温把水团绝热移到统一参考压力，便于比较热力状态。":"Potential temperature moves each parcel adiabatically to a common reference pressure, making thermodynamic states comparable.","位相":"Phase","温度、盐度、密度与状态方程":"Temperature, salinity, density and equation of state","温度、盐度与海水密度":"Temperature, salinity and seawater density","温盐密度":"Thermohaline density","温盐密度结构":"Thermosalt Density Structure","温盐密度三图需联合判读，单独用温度很难区分相似温度但来源不同的水团。":"The three graphs of temperature and salt density need to be interpreted jointly. It is difficult to distinguish water masses with similar temperatures but different sources using temperature alone.","温盐剖面":"Thermohaline profile","温盐跃层共同决定密跃层强度。":"The thermohalocline jointly determines the strength of the pycnocline.","温跃层":"thermocline","温跃层、盐跃层与浮力频率":"Thermocline, halocline and buoyancy frequency","稳定层结要求N²>0；若N²<0则可能发生对流翻转。":"Stable stratification requires N²>0; if N²<0, convective overturning may occur.","稳定层结中的密度为什么必须总体随深度增加？N² 又表达什么？":"Why must density in stable stratification generally increase with depth? What does N² mean?","问题进度":"Problem progress","涡旋、锋面与不稳定性":"Vortices, Fronts and Instabilities","我的回答":"my answer","我的知识外脑 · 学习材料仅用于课程与研究交流":"My External Knowledge Brain · Learning materials for coursework and research exchange","物理海洋学框架":"Physical Oceanography Framework","物性 · 过程 · 方法":"Physical properties · Process · Method","吸收产生加热，PAR驱动光合作用，出水辐亮度形成海色遥感信号。":"Absorption generates heating, PAR drives photosynthesis, and effluent radiance forms sea color remote sensing signals.","西太平洋海沟最深，反映太平洋板块向周缘俯冲。":"The western Pacific trench is the deepest, reflecting the subduction of the Pacific plate to its periphery.","下表采用":"The following table adopts","下一个问题":"next question","下一页":"Next page","下载 ERSST v5 NetCDF":"Download ERSST v5 NetCDF","下载 T_TIDE v1.5beta":"Download T_TIDE v1.5beta","下载当前示例 CSV":"Download current sample CSV","下载可复现程序 →":"Download reproducible program →","下载轻量版 PPTX":"Download the lightweight version PPTX","下载示例水位 CSV":"Download sample water level CSV","下载完整 MATLAB 程序":"Download the complete MATLAB program","下载完整 Python 程序":"Download the complete Python program","夏季浅混合层升温快，冬季冷却和风混合使混合层加深。":"The shallow mixed layer heats up quickly in summer, while cooling and wind mixing make the mixed layer deeper in winter.","先定位章节，再建立概念之间的连接。":"Locate chapters first and then establish connections between concepts.","先分析潮汐周期、传播时滞和天气尺度响应，再训练数据模型。":"Analyze tidal cycles, propagation delays, and synoptic-scale responses before training the data model.","先观看配套视频建立传播图像，再用右侧课件核对方程和边界条件。":"First watch the supporting video to establish the propagation image, and then use the courseware on the right to check the equations and boundary conditions.","先看中文示例，再运行本站程序":"Look at the Chinese example first, and then run the program on this site","先确认异常场、分析区域和面积权重；":"First confirm the abnormal field, analysis area and area weight;","先问关系，再选图形":"Ask about relationships first, then choose graphics","先用物理可解释的经典方法提取潮汐分量和主导时空模态，再把结果作为深度学习的基线、特征或残差目标。下面的程序、数据和工具均可直接下载。":"First, use physically interpretable classical methods to extract tidal components and dominant spatiotemporal modes, and then use the results as baselines, features, or residual targets for deep learning. The programs, data and tools below are available for direct download.","显著性":"Significance","现场观测":"On-site observation","校正误差会直接传递到叶绿素、悬沙等产品。":"Calibration errors will be directly transferred to products such as chlorophyll and suspended sediment.","写完了，查看核对要点":"After writing, check the check points","选择图形语法":"Choose a graphics grammar","学习进度":"learning progress","学习路线":"learning route","压力梯度力、科氏力、重力与摩擦":"Pressure gradient force, Coriolis force, gravity and friction","压力压缩导致的密度增加":"Density increase due to pressure compression","压力与深度的近似关系":"Approximate relationship between pressure and depth","沿岸传播与区域响应":"Coastal spread and regional response","沿岸低频水位与流速异常。CTWs 不等同于风浪，也不等同于天文潮。":"Low-frequency water level and flow velocity anomalies along the coast. CTWs are not equivalent to wind waves, nor are they equivalent to astronomical tides.","沿岸俘获波":"Coastally Trapped Waves","沿岸俘获波：海岸如何为波动导航":"Coastal Captured Waves: How Coasts Navigate Waves","沿岸俘获波传播机制课件画面":"Coastal captured wave propagation mechanism courseware screen","沿岸俘获波课件第1页":"Coastal captured wave courseware page 1","沿岸俘获波视频":"Coastal captured wave video","沿岸俘获波通常是数天至数月的低频过程，风浪多为秒级。":"Coastal captured waves are usually low-frequency processes lasting from days to months, and wind waves are mostly on the order of seconds.","沿岸俘获波与普通风浪最关键的尺度和约束差异是什么？":"What are the most critical scale and constraint differences between coastal captured waves and ordinary wind waves?","沿岸潜水区和开阔水冰间湖可发生强烈海气交换与致密水形成。":"Strong air-sea exchange and the formation of dense water can occur in coastal diving areas and open water polynyas.","研究量：":"Research volume:","研究扰动的传播、色散、变形和能量传递，是近岸海浪与沿岸低频波动研究的理论核心。":"Studying the propagation, dispersion, deformation and energy transfer of disturbances is the theoretical core of the study of nearshore waves and coastal low-frequency fluctuations.","盐度高值通常位于20°–30°副热带E>P区域。":"High salinity values are usually located in the 20°–30° subtropical E>P region.","盐度由电导率比、温度和压力按标准算法计算。":"Salinity is calculated from conductivity ratio, temperature and pressure according to standard algorithms.","颜色 / 大小":"color / size","洋中脊处生成的新洋壳最年轻，年龄随离开扩张中心而增大；老洋壳最终在俯冲带被消耗，因此海洋岩石圈远年轻于多数大陆。":"The new oceanic crust generated at the mid-ocean ridge is the youngest, and its age increases as it moves away from the spreading center; the old oceanic crust is eventually consumed at the subduction zone, so the oceanic lithosphere is much younger than most continents.","洋中脊抬升数千米；俯冲边界形成狭窄而深的海沟。":"Mid-ocean ridges rise thousands of meters; subduction boundaries form narrow, deep trenches.","遥感资料":"Remote sensing data","一列一个变量，一行一次观测":"One variable per column, one observation per row","一年记录有利于分离频率接近的分潮；短记录的可分辨分潮更少。":"One-year records are good for separating tides with close frequency; short records have fewer resolvable tides.","已保存在当前浏览器。":"Saved in current browser.","已恢复这道题的本机记录。":"The local record of this question has been restored.","已清空本机出门票记录。":"The ticket issuing record of this machine has been cleared.","以守恒定律和地球流体动力学为基础，解释旋转、层结与边界条件下的海水运动。":"Based on conservation laws and geohydrodynamics, explain seawater motion under rotation, stratification, and boundary conditions.","以下内容对应课件中的 9 个问题。答案先给可直接复述的结论，再说明物理原因、数量级与限定条件。":"The following content corresponds to the 9 questions in the courseware. The answer first gives a conclusion that can be directly restated, and then explains the physical reasons, orders of magnitude, and limiting conditions.","因为 EOF×PC 的乘积保持不变，整对模态乘以 −1 不改变重建场。跨研究比较时必须先统一符号约定，不能把正负号本身当作物理结论。":"Because the product EOF × PC remains unchanged, multiplying the entire pair of modes by −1 does not change the reconstructed field. When comparing across studies, sign conventions must be unified first, and the signs themselves cannot be regarded as physical conclusions.","印度洋90°E温盐密度断面":"Indian Ocean 90°E Thermohaline Density Section","印度洋断面显示热带暖水、南半球副热带温跃层和来自南大洋的深底层水；北部表层性质又受到季风、降水和海盆封闭的影响。":"The Indian Ocean section shows tropical warm water, the southern hemisphere subtropical thermocline and deep bottom water from the Southern Ocean; the properties of the northern surface are affected by monsoons, precipitation and ocean basin closure.","印度洋海盆地形":"Indian Ocean Basin Shape","印度洋由多条洋中脊分割，并在中部形成三联点；北部受亚洲大陆封闭，海盆几何与季风强迫共同塑造独特环流。":"The Indian Ocean is divided by multiple mid-ocean ridges, forming a triple junction in the middle; the north is closed by the Asian continent, and the ocean basin geometry and monsoon forcing jointly shape unique circulation.","映射字段":"Mapping fields","用 2–4 句话写出结论、物理原因和一个限定条件……":"In 2–4 sentences, write the conclusion, the physical reason, and a qualifying condition…","用可复现的统计与信号分析方法提取物理信息，为动力解释、数值模拟和机器学习提供基线。":"Extract physical information using reproducible statistical and signal analysis methods to provide a baseline for dynamic interpretation, numerical simulation, and machine learning.","用条形图展示各模态贡献率，并检查累计贡献率；模态编号是有序类别，不应被当作连续物理坐标。":"Use a bar chart to display the contribution rate of each mode and check the cumulative contribution rate; the mode numbers are ordered categories and should not be regarded as continuous physical coordinates.","有效波高、周期和波向。通常对应风浪与涌浪，是近岸海浪预测的直接对象。":"Significant wave height, period and wave direction. Usually corresponds to wind waves and swells, and is the direct object of nearshore wave prediction.","右图慢扩张脊可见明显轴谷与密集断裂条带。":"In the picture on the right, the slow-expanding ridge shows obvious axial valleys and dense fracture strips.","与":"with","与你的研究：":"Link to your research:","语言选择":"Language selection","预处理":"preprocessing","原位密度随深度增加不一定代表稳定层结，因为其中含有纯压缩效应。":"The increase in in situ density with depth does not necessarily represent stable stratification because of the pure compressional effects involved.","约 +10～−80":"About +10～−80","约 +40～+300":"About +40～+300","约 −20～−110":"About −20～−110","约 0～−250":"About 0～−250","阅读顺序":"reading order","阅读专题 →":"Read the topic →","运行环境：":"Operating environment:","再读空间型及其对应 PC；":"Read the spatial type and its corresponding PC again;","在 B 站打开完整课程（5节） →":"Open the complete course (5 lessons) at Station B →","在线预览为图片形式；轻量 PPTX 保留全部 19 页视觉内容，不含内嵌旁白。":"Online preview is in image form; lightweight PPTX retains all 19 pages of visual content without embedded narration.","展开读图重点":"Expand reading notes","长波辐射 Qb":"Long wave radiation Qb","爪哇—巽他海沟标志印度—澳大利亚板块向北俯冲。":"The Java-Sunda Trench marks the northward subduction of the Indo-Australian Plate.","这两项分别对应“通风温跃层”和“扩散温跃层”的经典解释；真实海洋中二者并存，表面加热/冷却提供浮力边界条件。":"These two items correspond to the classic explanations of \"ventilation thermocline\" and \"diffusion thermocline\" respectively; they coexist in the real ocean, and surface heating/cooling provides buoyancy boundary conditions.","这是课程中的一个专题故事，不是整站主题。建议按“概念 → 尺度辨析 → 视频 → 课件”的顺序学习。":"This is a featured story in the course, not the entire site. It is recommended to study in the order of \"Concept → Scale Analysis → Video → Courseware\".","真实剖面计算前需处理噪声与静力不稳定翻转。":"Noise and static instability overturning need to be dealt with before calculating the real profile.","蒸发、降水、径流与海冰过程":"Evaporation, precipitation, runoff and sea ice processes","整合潮位站、浮标、风场、气压、流速和海底地形等资料。":"Integrate data from tide stations, buoys, wind fields, air pressure, current velocity and seabed topography.","整理成长表":"Organize growth chart","正交约束是数学约束，不保证对应独立物理过程。":"Orthogonal constraints are mathematical constraints and are not guaranteed to correspond to independent physical processes.","知识框架":"knowledge framework","质量、动量、热量和盐度守恒":"Conservation of mass, momentum, heat, and salinity","质量控制、异常场、去趋势与面积权重":"Quality control, anomaly fields, detrending and area weighting","中":"中","中尺度过程":"mesoscale processes","中高纬海区，尤其西边界流延伸体、季风海区和部分边缘海。这里太阳辐射和风暴活动季节变化大，夏季浅而暖、冬季深而冷。":"Mid- and high-latitude sea areas, especially the western boundary current extension, monsoon sea areas and some marginal seas. Solar radiation and storm activity vary greatly here, with shallow and warm summers and deep and cold winters.","中央洋中脊从北冰洋延伸至南大洋。":"The Central Ocean Ridge extends from the Arctic Ocean to the Southern Ocean.","中印度洋脊、西南印度洋脊和东南印度洋脊构成扩张系统。":"The Central Indian Ridge, Southwest Indian Ridge and Southeast Indian Ridge constitute a spreading system.","重新开始":"Start over","主导航":"Main navigation","主模态、时间系数与方差贡献":"Main mode, time coefficient and variance contribution","主要分潮、振幅与相位":"Main tides, amplitude and phase","主要位于约 15°–35° 的副热带高压带和副热带环流区":"Mainly located in the subtropical high pressure zone and subtropical circulation area at about 15°–35°","主要原因是大西洋的蒸发相对降水更强，且大气把水汽从大西洋跨越中美洲和非洲输送到太平洋与印度洋，留下较高盐度；地中海高盐出流水也会抬高北大西洋中层盐度。较高盐度有利于北大西洋高纬水体增密和深水形成。":"The main reason is that evaporation in the Atlantic Ocean is stronger than precipitation, and the atmosphere transports water vapor from the Atlantic Ocean across Central America and Africa to the Pacific and Indian Oceans, leaving a higher salinity; high-salt outflow water from the Mediterranean Sea will also increase the salinity in the mid-level North Atlantic Ocean. Higher salinity is conducive to the densification of high-latitude water bodies and the formation of deep water in the North Atlantic.","主要作用力":"main force","专题 Story":"Topic Story","专业名称：沿岸俘获波 · Coastally Trapped Waves":"Professional name: Coastally Trapped Waves · Coastally Trapped Waves","状态方程是非线性的，同样温盐变化在不同背景状态下产生不同密度响应。":"The equation of state is nonlinear, and changes in temperature and salinity produce different density responses under different background states.","浊流可搬运大量沉积物并形成深海扇，也会威胁海底工程。":"Turbidity currents can transport large amounts of sediment and form deep-sea fans, and can also threaten seafloor engineering.","浊流是高含沙、密度大于周围海水的底层重力流。":"Turbidity currents are bottom gravity currents that are highly sandy and denser than the surrounding seawater.","资料来源":"Source","组织多源观测":"Organize multi-source observations","最大：":"Max:","最后检查方差贡献、模态可分离性与物理证据。":"Finally, variance contribution, modal separability and physical evidence are examined.","最强失热位于暖、干、少云的副热带海域，约 −80～−110":"The strongest heat loss is located in the warm, dry, less cloudy subtropical sea area, about −80 to −110","最强中心":"The strongest center","最弱中心":"weakest center","最小：":"Minimum:","左图快扩张脊的脊顶宽、起伏相对平滑。":"The fast-expanding ridge in the left picture has a wide ridge top and relatively smooth undulations.","做深层水团分类或EOF前的密度异常计算时，应写清参考压力和温盐标准。":"When classifying deep water masses or calculating density anomalies before EOF, the reference pressure and temperature and salt standards should be clearly written.","B站 · 调和分析讲座":"Station B · Harmonic Analysis Lecture","B站 · T_TIDE 工具包教程":"Bilibili · T_TIDE toolkit tutorial","B站图文教程逐项解释":"B station graphic tutorial explains step by step","Coastally Trapped Waves，简称 CTWs。它们受海岸边界、地球自转和大陆架地形共同约束，主要沿海岸方向传播，可表现为沿岸水位、流速和温度的低频变化。":"Coastally Trapped Waves, or CTWs for short. They are jointly constrained by the coastal boundary, the earth's rotation and the continental shelf topography. They mainly propagate along the coast and can be manifested as low-frequency changes in coastal water levels, current speeds and temperatures.","CTD直接测压力，再换算为深度或作为垂向坐标。":"CTD directly measures pressure and then converts it into depth or as vertical coordinate.","download>下载完整 MATLAB 程序</a><a href=":"download>Download the complete MATLAB program</a><a href=","download>下载完整 Python 程序</a><a href=":"download>Download the complete Python program</a><a href=","EOF 的正负号任意，程序用 Niño‑3.4 区域的空间均值统一符号，便于复现比较。":"The sign of EOF is arbitrary, and the program uses the spatial mean of the Niño-3.4 region to unify the sign to facilitate reproduction and comparison.","EOF 方差贡献":"EOF variance contribution","EOF 方差贡献率":"EOF variance contribution rate","EOF 分解究竟把什么拆开？":"What exactly does EOF decomposition dismantle?","EOF 和 PC 为什么可以同时反号？":"Why can EOF and PC be inverted at the same time?","EOF 经验正交分解":"EOF Decomposition","EOF 可视实验":"EOF Visual Lab","EOF 空间模态":"EOF space mode","EOF 模态选择":"EOF mode selection","EOF 是统计模态，不自动等于单一动力过程；解释时应结合海温、风场和海表高度等证据。":"EOF is a statistical mode and does not automatically equal a single dynamic process; the interpretation should be combined with evidence such as sea temperature, wind field and sea surface height.","EOF 是在给定变量、区域、时段和预处理下最大化方差的统计模态。":"EOF is the statistical mode that maximizes the variance for a given variable, region, period, and preprocessing.","EOF 五问五答":"EOF Five Questions and Answers","EOF 主成分时间序列教学示意图":"EOF principal component time series teaching diagram","EOF1 · 盆地尺度同号模态":"EOF1 · Basin-scale mode with the same sign","EOF1 方差贡献率最高，为什么仍不能直接说它就是某个确定的动力过程？":"EOF1 has the highest variance contribution rate, so why can't it be directly said that it is a certain dynamic process?","EOF1 只是在既定数据、区域和预处理下解释方差最多的统计模态。把它解释为 ENSO，还要核对 PC 与 Niño3.4、风应力、海表高度及独立资料的关系。":"EOF1 is simply the statistical mode that explains the most variance given the data, region, and preprocessing. To interpret this as ENSO, also check the relationship of PC to Niño3.4, wind stress, sea surface height and independent data.","EOF2 · 东西偶极模态":"EOF2 · East-West dipole mode","EOF3 · 赤道—副热带对比":"EOF3 · Equatorial-Subtropical Contrast","EOF经验正交分解基础解释":"Basic explanation of EOF empirical orthogonal decomposition","ITCZ、河口和高纬P>E区域盐度低。":"Salinity is low in the ITCZ, estuaries and high latitude P>E areas.","ITCZ、弱风湿润区和海冰区，接近 0～−30":"ITCZ, weak wind and humid zone and sea ice zone, close to 0~−30","J. Climate · 西边界流热交换":"J. Climate · Western Boundary Stream Heat Exchange","MIT OCW · 温跃层理论":"MIT OCW · Thermocline Theory","N² 是层结稳定度的量度；N² > 0 表示稳定，数值越大回复振荡越快。":"N² is a measure of stratification stability; N² > 0 indicates stability, and the larger the value, the faster the recovery from oscillation.","N控制内波传播、第一斜压变形半径和沿岸俘获波模态，是东海内潮研究的关键剖面量。":"N controls internal wave propagation, the first baroclinic deformation radius and the coastal captured wave mode, and is a key profile quantity in the study of internal tides in the East China Sea.","NOAA · 海洋温度结构":"NOAA · Ocean Temperature Structure","NOAA · 混合层定义":"NOAA · Mixed Layer Definition","NOAA 产品说明":"NOAA Product Description","NOAA 数据目录":"NOAA data catalog","NOAA 檀香山站 1612340，2023 年逐小时已验证水位":"NOAA Honolulu Station 1612340, 2023 hourly verified water levels","NOAA API 说明":"NOAA API Description","NOAA ERSST v5 月平均海表温度，热带太平洋 1982–2023":"NOAA ERSST v5 monthly mean sea surface temperature, tropical Pacific 1982–2023","NOAA GFDL · 海洋混合":"NOAA GFDL · Marine Mix","NOAA PMEL · 海表通量":"NOAA PMEL · Ocean surface flux","PC 标准化时间序列":"PC normalized time series","RAWGraphs 海洋学示例":"RAWGraphs Oceanography Example","RAWGraphs 学习模块":"RAWGraphs Learning Module","Rossby 数、地转平衡与位涡":"Rossby number, geostrophic equilibrium and potential vorticity","T_TIDE 潮汐调和分析":"T_TIDE tidal harmonic analysis","T_TIDE 调和分析":"T_TIDE harmonic analysis","T_TIDE 示例需要 MATLAB 与 T_TIDE 工具箱；EOF 示例需要 Python 3，以及":"T_TIDE examples require MATLAB and the T_TIDE toolbox; EOF examples require Python 3, and","T–S 点适合散点图：盐度映射到横轴、温度映射到纵轴、水团或深度映射到颜色。正式分析还应叠加等密度线。":"T–S points fit into a scatterplot: salinity is mapped to the horizontal axis, temperature to the vertical axis, and water mass or depth to color. Formal analysis should also overlay isopycnal lines.","WHOI OAFlux · 热通量气候态":"WHOI OAFlux · Heat flux climate state","σ0适合上层海洋，σ2、σ4常用于更深层。":"σ0 is suitable for the upper ocean, and σ2 and σ4 are often used for deeper layers.","σt是密度减去1000 kg m⁻³后的数值。":"σt is the density minus 1000 kg m⁻³.","我的知识外脑":"My External Knowledge Brain","位温":"Potential Temperature","位密度":"Potential Density","经验正交函数":"Empirical Orthogonal Function","海表温度":"Sea Surface Temperature","方差贡献":"Explained Variance"};
